{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VKU7U9Vu1iFL5ox1F5CjLT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '放弃 \"structural dominance\" 作为 primary claim。重构三条主轴：\n2\t\n3\t  (1) Primary → Claim 2 (label quality as transfer bottleneck)：+28pp 标签修复证据最 robust，不受\n4\t  encoder/LLM 对比影响。\n5\t\n6\t  (2) Claim 1 → \"cost-latency-accuracy Pareto advantage\"：<5ms + 零适配 + F1 0.967，不声称\n7\t  signal type superiority，声称 deployment efficiency。\n8\t\n9\t  (3) Claim 4 → \"preliminary evidence\"，移入 discussion。低 waste 比例 + 高误杀率限制 intervention\n10\t  天花板。\n11\t\n12\t  Anti-circularity 唯一证据：整体 gold GB 0.839 > MV 0.798 (p<0.001)。conf=1 分层承认 underpowered\n13\t  且 delta 接近零。\n14\t\n15\t  κ=0.39 reframe：stagnation 本身 definitionally ambiguous，首次量化歧义性比假装高 κ 更诚实更有信息量。\n16\t\n17\t  Human ceiling ~0.82 解释 GB 0.839 为何已 near-optimal——不是模型差，是任务本身的 agreement ceiling。\n18\t\n19\t  TLM negative (Claim 3) 重要性上升，作为 methodological contribution。\n20\t\n21\t  论文类型：从 \"framework paper\" 调为 \"empirical analysis paper with practical deployment\n22\t  guidelines\"。\n23\t\n24\t  目标仍为 EMNLP，projected consensus 3.5-4.0/6。\n25\t\n26\t  '\n27\timagined_experiments:\n28\t- name: Compute Waste Audit\n29\t  plan_id: compute-waste-audit\n30\t  description: 回溯分析 SWE-Agent + OpenHands 全量轨迹，量化 stagnation tail 长度及浪费的 token/step\n31\t    占比\n32\t  expected_results:\n33\t    swe_total_trajectories: 543\n34\t    swe_trajectories_with_stag_tail: 231\n35\t    swe_pct_with_tail: 42.5\n36\t    swe_mean_tail_length_windows: 3.8\n37\t    swe_median_tail_length_windows: 2\n38\t    swe_tail_steps_pct_of_total: 19.4\n39\t    swe_tail_tokens_pct_of_total: 16.8\n40\t    oh_total_trajectories: 3409\n41\t    oh_trajectories_with_stag_tail: 1278\n42\t    oh_pct_with_tail: 37.5\n43\t    oh_mean_tail_length_windows: 4.6\n44\t    oh_median_tail_length_windows: 3\n45\t    oh_tail_steps_pct_of_total: 17.1\n46\t    oh_tail_tokens_pct_of_total: 15.3\n47\t    combined_waste_steps_pct: 18.0\n48\t    combined_waste_tokens_pct: 15.9\n49\t    long_tail_ge10_pct_of_tailed: 11.2\n50\t    long_tail_contribution_to_waste: 48.3\n51\t    natural_termination_within_3_windows: 62.4\n52\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：compute waste <25%，多数轨迹在停滞后很快自然终止。\n53\t\n54\t    SWE-Agent stag_rate=28.5% 看似高，但 stagnation 窗口并非集中在轨迹尾部——许多是中段短暂停滞后恢复。\n55\t\n56\t    定义 \"stagnation tail\" 为轨迹末尾连续 stagnation 窗口块。约 40% 的轨迹有 tail，但 median tail 仅 2-3\n57\t    个窗口。\n58\t\n59\t    62% 的 tailed 轨迹在首次尾部停滞后 3 个窗口内自然终止（agent 自己放弃或触发 max-step 限制）。\n60\t\n61\t    Waste 的 80/20 法则：11% 的长尾轨迹（≥10 windows tail）贡献了近 50% 的浪费。大部分轨迹尾部很短，\n62\t\n63\t    early termination 的收益被\"本来也很快就结束\"的事实压缩。整体浪费 ~18% steps / ~16% tokens。\n64\t\n65\t    OH 的浪费略低于 SWE，因为 OH 轨迹整体更长但 stagnation tail 比例相对更小。\n66\t\n67\t    '\n68\t  tables:\n69\t  - name: 'Table: Stagnation Tail Statistics by Agent'\n70\t    content: '| Agent     | Trajectories | With Tail | % Tailed | Mean Tail (win)\n71\t      | Median | Waste (steps%) | Waste (tokens%) |\n72\t\n73\t      |-----------|-------------|-----------|----------|-----------------|--------|----------------|-----------------|\n74\t\n75\t      | SWE-Agent | 543         | 231       | 42.5%    | 3.8             | 2      |\n76\t      19.4%          | 16.8%           |\n77\t\n78\t      | OpenHands | 3409        | 1278      | 37.5%    | 4.6             | 3      |\n79\t      17.1%          | 15.3%           |\n80\t\n81\t      | Combined  | 3952        | 1509      | 38.2%    | 4.4             | 3      |\n82\t      18.0%          | 15.9%           |\n83\t\n84\t      '\n85\t  figures_description:\n86\t  - 'Histogram: stagnation tail length distribution (窗口数)，双峰分布——大量 tail=1-2 短尾 + 少量\n87\t    tail>10 长尾。标注 median 和 90th percentile。'\n88\t  - 'Stacked bar: 每条轨迹的 steps 分解为 progress / mid-stagnation / stagnation-tail，按 tail\n89\t    长度排序。展示浪费集中在少数长尾轨迹。'\n90\t  analysis: '18% waste 是 intervention 故事的天花板——即使完美检测 + 即时终止，也只能省 18%。\n91\t\n92\t    实际 early termination 必须等待连续 k 个 stagnation 窗口确认，因此实际节省 < 18%。\n93\t\n94\t    大部分浪费集中在少数长尾轨迹（~11% of tailed trajectories contribute ~48% waste），\n95\t\n96\t    意味着 intervention 的边际收益递减很快。叙事调整：不声称 \"大规模计算节省\"，\n97\t\n98\t    改为 \"for the subset of trajectories with extended stagnation tails (X%), early\n99\t    termination saves Y%\"。\n100\t\n101\t    '\n102\t- name: Early Termination Simulation\n103\t  plan_id: early-termination-simulation\n104\t  description: 模拟不同连续停滞阈值的 early stopping policy，量化 precision/recall/savings/task\n105\t    success trade-off\n106\t  expected_results:\n107\t    threshold_k1:\n108\t      precision: 0.58\n109\t      recall: 0.94\n110\t      compute_saved_pct: 16.2\n111\t      task_success_preserved_pct: 74.8\n112\t      false_kill_rate: 0.42\n113\t    threshold_k2:\n114\t      precision: 0.67\n115\t      recall: 0.88\n116\t      compute_saved_pct: 14.7\n117\t      task_success_preserved_pct: 79.3\n118\t      false_kill_rate: 0.33\n119\t    threshold_k3:\n120\t      precision: 0.74\n121\t      recall: 0.79\n122\t      compute_saved_pct: 13.1\n123\t      task_success_preserved_pct: 83.4\n124\t      false_kill_rate: 0.26\n125\t    threshold_k5:\n126\t      precision: 0.83\n127\t      recall: 0.61\n128\t      compute_saved_pct: 10.2\n129\t      task_success_preserved_pct: 87.1\n130\t      false_kill_rate: 0.17\n131\t    threshold_k7:\n132\t      precision: 0.89\n133\t      recall: 0.44\n134\t      compute_saved_pct: 7.6\n135\t      task_success_preserved_pct: 91.2\n136\t      false_kill_rate: 0.11\n137\t    best_operating_point_k: 3\n138\t    best_compute_saved_pct: 13.1\n139\t    best_task_success_preserved_pct: 83.4\n140\t    oracle_compute_saved_pct: 18.0\n141\t    random_baseline_efficiency: 0.52\n142\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档假设：early termination 节省有限 (10-20%) 且误杀率高 (task success\n143\t    <88%)。\n144\t\n145\t    k=1 过于激进：单个 stagnation 窗口就终止，误杀 42% 的实际 making-progress 轨迹。\n146\t\n147\t    问题在于 stagnation 标签的 recall 瓶颈（conf=2 上 recall_stag 仅 0.77）——模型自信但错误地\n148\t\n149\t    预测 stagnation 的 FP 案例 (error-analysis: FP 65%, mean prob=0.922) 直接转化为误杀。\n150\t\n151\t    k=3 是 sweet spot 但 trade-off 仍不理想：节省 13% compute（远低于 18% oracle ceiling），\n152\t\n153\t    保留 83% task success（意味着 17% 的原本可解决任务被错误终止）。\n154\t\n155\t    k≥5 误杀率低但 recall 骤降——大部分短尾轨迹（median tail=2-3 windows）在 k=5 确认前已自然终止。\n156\t\n157\t    核心问题：stagnation tail 短 + 检测器 FP confident = intervention 价值有限。\n158\t\n159\t    '\n160\t  tables:\n161\t  - name: 'Table: Early Termination Threshold Sweep'\n162\t    content: '| k | Precision | Recall | Compute Saved (%) | Task Success (%) | False\n163\t      Kill Rate |\n164\t\n165\t      |---|-----------|--------|-------------------|------------------|-----------------|\n166\t\n167\t      | 1 | 0.58      | 0.94   | 16.2              | 74.8             | 0.42            |\n168\t\n169\t      | 2 | 0.67      | 0.88   | 14.7              | 79.3             | 0.33            |\n170\t\n171\t      | 3 | 0.74      | 0.79   | 13.1              | 83.4             | 0.26            |\n172\t\n173\t      | 5 | 0.83      | 0.61   | 10.2              | 87.1             | 0.17            |\n174\t\n175\t      | 7 | 0.89      | 0.44   | 7.6               | 91.2             | 0.11            |\n176\t\n177\t      '\n178\t  figures_description:\n179\t  - 'Precision-Recall curve: 不同 k 阈值下的 PR 曲线，标注每个 k 的 operating point。'\n180\t  analysis: 'Best operating point (k=3) 节省 13% compute 但损失 17% task success——对工业部署而言\n181\t    risk-reward 不够好。\n182\t\n183\t    论文需降级 Claim 4：从 \"compute-efficient intervention\" 降为 \"preliminary evidence that\n184\t    early termination\n185\t\n186\t    is feasible for the subset of trajectories with extended stagnation\"。\n187\t\n188\t    强调 structural detector 的低延迟 (<5ms) 是部署 intervention 的前提条件（LLM judge 不可能做实时 termination），\n189\t\n190\t    但不声称当前 trade-off 已经 production-ready。\n191\t\n192\t    '\n193\t- name: Cost-Effectiveness Pareto Curve\n194\t  plan_id: cost-effectiveness-pareto\n195\t  description: Pareto 前沿：compute saved vs task success preserved，structural vs oracle\n196\t    vs random\n197\t  expected_results:\n198\t    pareto_points_structural:\n199\t    - compute_saved_pct: 16.2\n200\t      task_success_pct: 74.8\n201\t      k: 1\n202\t    - compute_saved_pct: 14.7\n203\t      task_success_pct: 79.3\n204\t      k: 2\n205\t    - compute_saved_pct: 13.1\n206\t      task_success_pct: 83.4\n207\t      k: 3\n208\t    - compute_saved_pct: 10.2\n209\t      task_success_pct: 87.1\n210\t      k: 5\n211\t    - compute_saved_pct: 7.6\n212\t      task_success_pct: 91.2\n213\t      k: 7\n214\t    oracle_point:\n215\t      compute_saved_pct: 18.0\n216\t      task_success_pct: 100.0\n217\t    random_policy_auc: 0.52\n218\t    structural_policy_auc: 0.71\n219\t    oracle_auc: 1.0\n220\t    structural_vs_oracle_efficiency: 0.71\n221\t  result_rationale: 'Oracle ceiling 仅 18% compute saved（因 waste 本身就低），structural detector\n222\t    Pareto 前沿在 oracle 下方。\n223\t\n224\t    Random baseline AUC=0.52（对角线附近），structural AUC=0.71——比 random 好但远非 oracle。\n225\t\n226\t    关键视觉信息：oracle 和 structural 曲线之间的 gap 来自 detector FP（confident 但错误的 stagnation\n227\t    预测）。\n228\t\n229\t    低 oracle ceiling + detector imperfection = intervention 的实用空间被双重压缩。\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t  tables: []\n233\t  figures_description:\n234\t  - 'Pareto plot: 横轴 compute saved (%), 纵轴 task success preserved (%)。三条曲线：oracle\n235\t    (flat at 100% then drop), structural (concave), random (diagonal)。标注各 k 值的 operating\n236\t    point。Oracle ceiling 18% 用虚线标注。'\n237\t  analysis: '图的核心 message：intervention 的绝对天花板有限（最多省 18%），且检测器无法完全到达天花板。\n238\t\n239\t    在 worst 档下，这张图从 \"compelling deployment story\" 降级为 \"proof of concept\"。\n240\t\n241\t    论文应诚实呈现：intervention 对少数长尾轨迹有价值，但不是 general-purpose compute saver。\n242\t\n243\t    Pareto 图仍有学术价值——建立了从 detection 到 intervention 的方法论桥梁，为未来更好的检测器设定 benchmark。\n244\t\n245\t    '\n246\t- name: LLM-as-Judge on OpenHands\n247\t  plan_id: llm-on-oh\n248\t  description: 在 OH 轨迹上运行 LLM judge 全套 variants，与 structural GB 做 matched cross-agent\n249\t    对比\n250\t  expected_results:\n251\t    oh_subset_n: 2000\n252\t    claude_zeroshot:\n253\t      macro_f1: 0.793\n254\t      f1_stag: 0.748\n255\t      f1_prog: 0.838\n256\t      cost_usd: 14.2\n257\t      parse_failures: 3\n258\t    claude_fewshot:\n259\t      macro_f1: 0.836\n260\t      f1_stag: 0.802\n261\t      f1_prog: 0.87\n262\t      cost_usd: 42.6\n263\t      parse_failures: 0\n264\t    claude_cot:\n265\t      macro_f1: 0.841\n266\t      f1_stag: 0.811\n267\t      f1_prog: 0.871\n268\t      cost_usd: 19.5\n269\t      parse_failures: 1\n270\t    claude_fewshot_cot:\n271\t      macro_f1: 0.872\n272\t      f1_stag: 0.843\n273\t      f1_prog: 0.901\n274\t      cost_usd: 47.3\n275\t      parse_failures: 0\n276\t    gpt55_zeroshot:\n277\t      macro_f1: 0.824\n278\t      f1_stag: 0.789\n279\t      f1_prog: 0.859\n280\t      parse_failures: 187\n281\t      parse_failure_rate: 0.094\n282\t      cost_usd: 13.8\n283\t    best_llm_variant: claude_fewshot_cot\n284\t    best_llm_macro_f1: 0.872\n285\t    structural_gb_oh_all_macro_f1: 0.967\n286\t    structural_vs_best_llm_gap_pp: 9.5\n287\t    swe_best_llm_macro_f1: 0.799\n288\t    oh_vs_swe_llm_improvement_pp: 7.3\n289\t    total_cost_usd: 137.4\n290\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：LLM 在 OH 上 F1 0.82-0.90，gap 缩至 7-15pp。\n291\t\n292\t    OH 轨迹比 SWE 更结构化（OpenHands 使用更规范的 action space 和更清晰的 step boundary），\n293\t\n294\t    LLM 更容易从文本中判断 progress vs stagnation。SWE-Agent 轨迹中有大量 shell output noise\n295\t\n296\t    和 file content dump，干扰 LLM 判断；OH 轨迹更干净。\n297\t\n298\t    Claude few-shot-CoT 在 SWE 上 0.799，在 OH 上跳到 0.872 (+7.3pp)——显示 LLM 性能高度 task-dependent。\n299\t\n300\t    GPT-5.5 zero-shot在 OH 上 0.824（超过 Claude SWE few-shot 0.751），进一步确认 OH 对 LLM 更友好。\n301\t\n302\t    Gap 从 16.8pp (SWE) 缩小到 9.5pp (OH)——structural 仍然更好，但 \"dominance\" 需要 reframe。\n303\t\n304\t    LLM 的优势：不需要任何训练数据，适用于任何 agent；劣势：$47/2000 windows = $3500+/full OH dataset + 高延迟。\n305\t\n306\t    这使得 headline comparison 从 \"structural >> LLM (+16.8pp)\" 变为 \"structural > LLM (+9.5pp)\n307\t    at 1000x lower cost\"。\n308\t\n309\t    '\n310\t  tables:\n311\t  - name: 'Table: LLM Judge Variants on OpenHands (N=2000)'\n312\t    content: '| Method                | Macro F1 | F1_stag | F1_prog | Cost ($) |\n313\t      Gap vs Struct (pp) |\n314\t\n315\t      |-----------------------|----------|---------|---------|----------|--------------------|\n316\t\n317\t      | Claude zero-shot      | 0.793    | 0.748   | 0.838   | 14.20    | -17.4              |\n318\t\n319\t      | Claude few-shot       | 0.836    | 0.802   | 0.870   | 42.60    | -13.1              |\n320\t\n321\t      | Claude CoT            | 0.841    | 0.811   | 0.871   | 19.50    | -12.6              |\n322\t\n323\t      | Claude few-shot-CoT   | 0.872    | 0.843   | 0.901   | 47.30    | -9.5               |\n324\t\n325\t      | GPT-5.5 zero-shot     | 0.824    | 0.789   | 0.859   | 13.80    | -14.3              |\n326\t\n327\t      | Structural GB (ref)   | 0.967    | 0.948   | 0.987   | ~0       | —                  |\n328\t\n329\t      '\n330\t  figures_description:\n331\t  - 'Bar chart: SWE vs OH 上各方法 F1 对比，双组柱状图。展示 LLM 在 OH 上系统性提升 + gap 缩小。'\n332\t  analysis: 'Gap 缩小到 9.5pp 意味着 \"structural >> LLM\" 的叙事不再成立。\n333\t\n334\t    Reframe 为三维 Pareto：cost ($0 vs $47) × latency (<5ms vs ~2s) × accuracy (0.967\n335\t    vs 0.872)。\n336\t\n337\t    Structural 在所有三个维度上都更优或持平——这是 deployment efficiency story，不是 signal superiority\n338\t    story。\n339\t\n340\t    对 EMNLP reviewer：9.5pp 差距在统计上显著（bootstrap 可确认），但实用差距变小——\n341\t\n342\t    reviewer 可能认为 \"LLM only 10pp behind and improving fast\" 削弱了核心贡献。\n343\t\n344\t    应对：强调零数据部署 + 实时推理两个 LLM 无法匹配的属性。\n345\t\n346\t    '\n347\t- name: Conf=1 Gold Error Decomposition\n348\t  plan_id: conf1-gold-error-decomposition\n349\t  description: 在 282 个 conf=1 gold 窗口上分解 GB-correct-MV-wrong / both-wrong / GB-wrong-MV-correct\n350\t  expected_results:\n351\t    conf1_gold_n: 282\n352\t    gold_label_dist_stag: 118\n353\t    gold_label_dist_prog: 164\n354\t    gb_macro_f1: 0.66\n355\t    gb_accuracy: 0.69\n356\t    gb_f1_stag: 0.59\n357\t    gb_f1_prog: 0.73\n358\t    mv_accuracy: 0.71\n359\t    mv_f1_proxy: 0.68\n360\t    gb_minus_mv_accuracy_delta_pp: -2.0\n361\t    decomposition:\n362\t      gb_correct_mv_correct: 152\n363\t      gb_correct_mv_wrong: 43\n364\t      gb_wrong_mv_correct: 49\n365\t      gb_wrong_mv_wrong: 38\n366\t    gb_correct_mv_wrong_pct: 15.2\n367\t    gb_wrong_mv_correct_pct: 17.4\n368\t    net_gb_advantage_windows: -6\n369\t    net_gb_advantage_pct: -2.1\n370\t    bootstrap_delta_ci95:\n371\t    - -8.2\n372\t    - 3.9\n373\t    bootstrap_p: 0.31\n374\t    gb_error_by_gold_label:\n375\t      on_gold_stag:\n376\t        precision: 0.62\n377\t        recall: 0.57\n378\t      on_gold_prog:\n379\t        precision: 0.74\n380\t        recall: 0.78\n381\t  result_rationale: \"Worst 档核心假设：conf=1 gold 上 GB ≈ MV 或 GB 更差，delta <1pp 或为负。\\nConf=1\\\n382\t    \\ 窗口是 LFs 意见分歧的——恰好是 MV 标签最不可靠的区域。在这些窗口上：\\n(a) GB 训练时这些窗口被 downweight（conf=1 不参与\\\n383\t    \\ conf≥2 训练集），模型从未专门优化过这个分布；\\n(b) MV 在 conf=1 上其实有 base rate advantage——如果 2/3\\\n384\t    \\ LFs 说 progress，MV=progress，\\n    且由于 progress 是多数类（stag_rate ~28%），MV 的 progress\\\n385\t    \\ 猜测经常碰对；\\n(c) GB 在 conf=1 上依赖从 conf≥2 训练数据学到的决策边界，但 conf=1 的特征分布与 conf≥2 不同\\n\\\n386\t    \\   （更模糊、更多 edge case），导致 transfer 降级。\\nDecomposition 显示 GB-correct-MV-wrong (43)\\\n387\t    \\ 与 GB-wrong-MV-correct (49) 几乎持平，净差 -6 窗口。\\nBootstrap p=0.31 完全不显著——不能拒绝 \\\"GB\\\n388\t    \\ 和 MV 在 conf=1 上等效\\\" 的零假设。\\n这彻底摧毁了 \\\"model learns soft decision boundaries beyond\\\n389\t    \\ LF heuristics\\\" 的 claim。\\n模型在 LFs 失效的地方也失效了——anti-circularity 的核心证据链断裂。\\n\"\n390\t  tables:\n391\t  - name: 'Table: Error Decomposition on Conf=1 Gold Windows (N=282)'\n392\t    content: '|                    | MV Correct | MV Wrong |\n393\t\n394\t      |--------------------|-----------|----------|\n395\t\n396\t      | **GB Correct**     | 152 (53.9%)| 43 (15.2%)|\n397\t\n398\t      | **GB Wrong**       | 49 (17.4%) | 38 (13.5%)|\n399\t\n400\t      Net GB advantage: -6 windows (-2.1%), p=0.31 (n.s.)\n401\t\n402\t      '\n403\t  - name: 'Table: Conf-Stratified Gold Performance'\n404\t    content: '| Confidence | N   | GB F1 | MV Acc | GB-MV Δ (pp) | p-value |\n405\t\n406\t      |-----------|-----|-------|--------|--------------|---------|\n407\t\n408\t      | conf=1    | 282 | 0.66  | 0.71   | -2.0         | 0.31    |\n409\t\n410\t      | conf≥2    | 223 | 0.87  | 0.83   | +4.0         | 0.003   |\n411\t\n412\t      | Overall   | 505 | 0.839 | 0.798  | +4.1         | 0.0001  |\n413\t\n414\t      '\n415\t  figures_description:\n416\t  - 'Stacked bar: conf=1 vs conf≥2 的 error decomposition 四象限分布对比，视觉化展示 conf=1 上 GB\n417\t    优势消失。'\n418\t  analysis: '整体 gold GB 0.839 > MV 0.798 的优势完全来自 conf≥2 子集（223 windows, Δ=+4pp, p=0.003）。\n419\t\n420\t    Conf=1（282 windows）上 GB 与 MV 等效甚至略差——\"beyond-LF soft decision boundary\" claim\n421\t    不成立。\n422\t\n423\t    Reframe：GB 在 LFs 一致时做得好（trivially——学会了 LF 逻辑），在 LFs 分歧时不比 MV 更好。\n424\t\n425\t    Anti-circularity 退守为：整体 gold GB > MV (p<0.001) 证明模型至少不比投票差，\n426\t\n427\t    加上 human ceiling 论证（annotators 自己也只 agree ~80%）解释为什么 conf=1 上谁都做不好。\n428\t\n429\t    '\n430\t- name: BGE-M3 Probe Zero-Shot Cross-Agent Transfer\n431\t  plan_id: cross-agent-probe-bge\n432\t  description: BGE-M3 probe 在 OH 上 zero-shot 迁移，测试 +39.4pp gap 是否 encoder-dependent\n433\t  expected_results:\n434\t    encoder: BGE-M3\n435\t    bge_indomain_swe_macro_f1: 0.9413\n436\t    bge_zeroshot_oh_all_macro_f1: 0.78\n437\t    bge_zeroshot_oh_all_f1_stag: 0.69\n438\t    bge_zeroshot_oh_all_f1_prog: 0.87\n439\t    bge_zeroshot_oh_conf2_macro_f1: 0.82\n440\t    bge_zeroshot_oh_conf2_f1_stag: 0.74\n441\t    bge_zeroshot_oh_conf2_f1_prog: 0.9\n442\t    qwen_zeroshot_oh_all_macro_f1: 0.5984\n443\t    gap_bge_vs_qwen_pp: 18.2\n444\t    structural_gb_oh_all: 0.9674\n445\t    structural_vs_bge_zeroshot_gap_pp: 18.7\n446\t    structural_vs_qwen_zeroshot_gap_pp: 36.9\n447\t    gap_reduction_pct: 49.3\n448\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档假设：BGE probe zero-shot 达到 0.72-0.82，gap 缩至 <20pp。\n449\t\n450\t    BGE-M3 是多语言/多任务 encoder，representation 更通用。Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B 参数更少且\n451\t\n452\t    训练目标不同——其 zero-shot 0.598 可能部分反映了 encoder 质量而非 stagnation signal 的不可迁移性。\n453\t\n454\t    BGE 的更强 representation 可以更好地编码 agent 行为的语义相似性（即使跨 agent），\n455\t\n456\t    零样本从 0.598 跳到 0.78 (+18.2pp)。这意味着 ~50% 的 \"structural advantage\" 其实是 encoder choice\n457\t    问题。\n458\t\n459\t    结构特征仍领先 18.7pp，但叙事从 \"probe fundamentally fails at zero-shot\" 变为\n460\t\n461\t    \"stronger encoders close half the gap, structural advantage is partially deployment\n462\t    convenience\"。\n463\t\n464\t    BGE 在 conf≥2 上 0.82（高于 all 的 0.78）——conf≥2 标签更干净，probe 从中受益更多。\n465\t\n466\t    '\n467\t  tables:\n468\t  - name: 'Table: Encoder Comparison — Zero-Shot Cross-Agent on OH'\n469\t    content: '| Encoder             | In-domain F1 | OH Zero-shot F1 | OH conf≥2 F1\n470\t      | Gap vs Struct (pp) |\n471\t\n472\t      |---------------------|-------------|-----------------|-------------|-------------------|\n473\t\n474\t      | Qwen3-0.6B (orig)   | 0.906       | 0.598           | 0.532*      | -36.9             |\n475\t\n476\t      | BGE-M3              | 0.941       | 0.780           | 0.820       | -18.7             |\n477\t\n478\t      | E5-large-v2         | 0.936       | 0.720           | 0.760       | -24.7             |\n479\t\n480\t      | Structural GB (ref) | 0.995†      | 0.967           | 0.992       | —                 |\n481\t\n482\t      † circular eval caveat   * old labels\n483\t\n484\t      '\n485\t  figures_description:\n486\t  - 'Grouped bar: 三个 encoder 的 in-domain vs zero-shot cross-agent 对比，加 structural\n487\t    baseline 虚线。'\n488\t  analysis: 'Gap 从 36.9pp 缩至 18.7pp（BGE）——\"structural dominance\" claim 的 headline\n489\t    number 需大幅修正。\n490\t\n491\t    不能再说 \"+39.4pp gap\"（那是 Qwen-specific），需改为 \"structural outperforms best zero-shot\n492\t    probe by 18.7pp\"。\n493\t\n494\t    Reframe 论点：structural advantage 是 encoder-agnostic 的（18.7pp 仍然大且显著），但幅度取决于 encoder\n495\t    质量。\n496\t\n497\t    关键 reviewer 反驳：\"如果用更大的 encoder（e.g., 7B）差距会不会继续缩小？\" ——\n498\t\n499\t    需要在 limitations 中承认，但同时指出更大 encoder = 更高 inference cost，拉回 deployment efficiency\n500\t    叙事。\n501\t\n502\t    '\n503\t- name: E5-large Probe Zero-Shot Cross-Agent Transfer\n504\t  plan_id: cross-agent-probe-e5\n505\t  description: E5-large-v2 probe 在 OH 上 zero-shot 迁移，第二个 encoder 验证\n506\t  expected_results:\n507\t    encoder: E5-large-v2\n508\t    e5_indomain_swe_macro_f1: 0.9363\n509\t    e5_zeroshot_oh_all_macro_f1: 0.72\n510\t    e5_zeroshot_oh_all_f1_stag: 0.62\n511\t    e5_zeroshot_oh_all_f1_prog: 0.82\n512\t    e5_zeroshot_oh_conf2_macro_f1: 0.76\n513\t    e5_zeroshot_oh_conf2_f1_stag: 0.67\n514\t    e5_zeroshot_oh_conf2_f1_prog: 0.85\n515\t    gap_e5_vs_qwen_pp: 12.2\n516\t    structural_vs_e5_zeroshot_gap_pp: 24.7\n517\t  result_rationale: 'E5-large-v2 零样本迁移 0.72，比 Qwen 的 0.598 好 12.2pp 但不如 BGE 的 0.78。\n518\t\n519\t    E5 是单语言 encoder (English-only)，representation 质量介于 Qwen 和 BGE 之间。\n520\t\n521\t    Gap 24.7pp 仍然大——确认 structural advantage 不完全是 encoder 问题，但 encoder 确实是影响因素。\n522\t\n523\t    三个 encoder 的零样本 F1 排序 (0.598 < 0.72 < 0.78) 与其在 standard NLP benchmarks 上的排名一致，\n524\t\n525\t    暗示 \"更好的通用 encoder = 更好的零样本迁移\"，这对 structural features 的叙事不利。\n526\t\n527\t    '\n528\t  tables: []\n529\t  figures_description: []\n530\t  analysis: '三 encoder 数据点建立了 encoder quality → zero-shot transfer 的正相关。\n531\t\n532\t    论文需诚实呈现：structural advantage 的一部分来自 \"我们选的 encoder 不够强\"。\n533\t\n534\t    但核心论点可以保留：即使最好的 encoder (BGE) 也落后 18.7pp，\n535\t\n536\t    且 probe 需要 ~10% 目标域数据才能接近 structural（BGE 10% FT 约 0.92 vs structural 0.967 = 4.7pp\n537\t    gap）。\n538\t\n539\t    '\n540\t- name: 2-LF Coverage Analysis\n541\t  plan_id: 2lf-coverage-analysis\n542\t  description: 精确量化 2-LF config 在 OH 上的 conf≥2 覆盖率及 deployment coverage gap\n543\t  expected_results:\n544\t    swe_3lf_conf2_windows: 15401\n545\t    swe_2lf_conf2_windows: 10243\n546\t    swe_2lf_coverage_of_3lf_pct: 66.5\n547\t    oh_total_windows: 150652\n548\t    oh_3lf_conf2_windows: 43376\n549\t    oh_2lf_conf2_windows: 4017\n550\t    oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_of_total_pct: 2.7\n551\t    oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_of_3lf_pct: 9.3\n552\t    oh_2lf_conf1_windows: 72554\n553\t    oh_2lf_any_label_windows: 76571\n554\t    oh_2lf_any_coverage_pct: 50.8\n555\t    oh_no_label_windows: 74081\n556\t    oh_no_label_pct: 49.2\n557\t    deployment_scenarios:\n558\t      conf2_only:\n559\t        coverage_pct: 2.7\n560\t        expected_f1: 0.978\n561\t        note: high precision, near-zero coverage\n562\t      conf1_included:\n563\t        coverage_pct: 50.8\n564\t        expected_f1_upper: 0.92\n565\t        expected_f1_lower: 0.85\n566\t        note: moderate coverage, noisier labels\n567\t      full_prediction:\n568\t        coverage_pct: 100\n569\t        method: model predicts on all windows regardless of LF coverage\n570\t        expected_f1_cross_agent: 0.66\n571\t        note: 'RF cross-agent 2-LF: 0.78 all, but training data limited'\n572\t  result_rationale: '2-LF config 在 SWE 上 coverage 还行（66.5% of 3-LF conf≥2），但在 OH 上崩塌到\n573\t    2.7%。\n574\t\n575\t    原因：OH 上 cmd_rep 仅 fire 5.4%（vs SWE ~65%），移除 OB 后仅剩 file_diff + cmd_rep，\n576\t\n577\t    两者都 fire 的窗口极少。OH 的 action space 不同——更少 command repetition。\n578\t\n579\t    这对 \"2-LF deployable config\" claim 是致命打击：在目标域 (OH) 上几乎没有高置信标签。\n580\t\n581\t    Deployment 场景分析：(a) 只用 conf≥2 = 2.7% 覆盖率，等于没部署；\n582\t\n583\t    (b) 包含 conf=1 = 50.8% 但标签噪声大；(c) 全量预测需模型泛化到无 LF 覆盖区域。\n584\t\n585\t    E1-2lf-crossagent 已显示 2-LF RF 在 conf≥2 仅 -1.8pp，但那是在有 coverage 的极少窗口上。\n586\t\n587\t    '\n588\t  tables:\n589\t  - name: 'Table: 2-LF Coverage by Agent and Confidence'\n590\t    content: '| Setting            | SWE-Agent    | OpenHands    |\n591\t\n592\t      |--------------------|-------------|-------------|\n593\t\n594\t      | 3-LF conf≥2       | 15,401      | 43,376      |\n595\t\n596\t      | 2-LF conf≥2       | 10,243 (66.5%)| 4,017 (9.3%)|\n597\t\n598\t      | 2-LF conf≥1       | —           | 76,571 (50.8%)|\n599\t\n600\t      | No LF coverage    | —           | 74,081 (49.2%)|\n601\t\n602\t      '\n603\t  figures_description:\n604\t  - 'Pie chart pair: SWE vs OH 的 2-LF coverage 分布（conf≥2 / conf=1 / no coverage），视觉化\n605\t    coverage 崩塌。'\n606\t  analysis: '2-LF \"deployable config\" 在 OH 上几乎不可部署。0.978 F1 是在 2.7% coverage 上的——\n607\t\n608\t    统计上对但实际无用。论文需修改 2-LF 叙事：不声称 \"deployable without OB\"，\n609\t\n610\t    改为 \"2-LF 在 LF overlap 区域 label consistent，但 coverage 高度 agent-dependent，\n611\t\n612\t    real deployment needs LF adaptation or supplementary labeling sources\"。\n613\t\n614\t    这进一步支持 Claim 2（label quality/coverage as bottleneck）作为更 robust 的主 claim。\n615\t\n616\t    '\n617\t- name: Calibration Analysis\n618\t  plan_id: calibration-analysis\n619\t  description: Reliability diagrams + ECE for GB/RF on silver and gold\n620\t  expected_results:\n621\t    gb_silver:\n622\t      ece_raw: 0.061\n623\t      ece_tempcal: 0.045\n624\t      brier_raw: 0.063\n625\t      brier_tempcal: 0.059\n626\t      temperature: 2.06\n627\t      bimodal_gt09_pct: 64.4\n628\t      bimodal_lt01_pct: 21.7\n629\t    gb_gold:\n630\t      ece_raw: 0.118\n631\t      ece_tempcal: 0.058\n632\t      brier_raw: 0.142\n633\t      brier_tempcal: 0.121\n634\t      temperature: 2.85\n635\t    rf_silver:\n636\t      ece_raw: 0.042\n637\t      ece_tempcal: 0.038\n638\t    rf_gold:\n639\t      ece_raw: 0.097\n640\t      ece_tempcal: 0.052\n641\t    mid_range_overconfident: true\n642\t    mid_range_04_07_confidence_vs_actual: 45-63% conf vs 12-23% actual\n643\t  result_rationale: 'Registry 已有 silver 数据（ECE tempcal 0.0451）。Gold 上 calibration\n644\t    会更差因为：\n645\t\n646\t    (a) 模型在 silver labels 上训练——对 silver 天然 well-calibrated；\n647\t\n648\t    (b) gold labels 代表 human judgment，与 silver 有 ~20% divergence；\n649\t\n650\t    (c) 模型输出高度 bimodal（64% >0.9, 22% <0.1），中间区间严重 overconfident。\n651\t\n652\t    Temperature scaling 部分缓解（ECE 降 25%），但 gold 上 ECE 仍 ~0.058——\n653\t\n654\t    在 worst 档范围 [0.04, 0.06] 的上端。这限制了模型概率输出作为 confidence score 的可靠性，\n655\t\n656\t    对 deployment（尤其是 early termination threshold 设置）有直接影响。\n657\t\n658\t    '\n659\t  tables:\n660\t  - name: 'Table: Calibration Metrics'\n661\t    content: '| Model | Eval Set | ECE (raw) | ECE (temp) | Brier (raw) | Temperature\n662\t      |\n663\t\n664\t      |-------|----------|-----------|------------|-------------|-------------|\n665\t\n666\t      | GB    | Silver   | 0.061     | 0.045      | 0.063       | 2.06        |\n667\t\n668\t      | GB    | Gold     | 0.118     | 0.058      | 0.142       | 2.85        |\n669\t\n670\t      | RF    | Silver   | 0.042     | 0.038      | —           | —           |\n671\t\n672\t      | RF    | Gold     | 0.097     | 0.052      | —           | —           |\n673\t\n674\t      '\n675\t  figures_description:\n676\t  - 'Reliability diagram 2×2: GB/RF × Silver/Gold。对角线=perfect calibration，bar=actual。展示\n677\t    mid-range overconfidence 和 gold 上 calibration 降级。'\n678\t  analysis: 'Silver 上 ECE 0.045 (tempcal) 在 acceptable 范围，但 gold 上跳到 0.058——\n679\t\n680\t    说明模型对 silver labels 过拟合了 calibration。对 deployment claim：\n681\t\n682\t    模型说 \"90% 确信是 stagnation\" 时在 gold 上实际只有 ~78% 准确——\n683\t\n684\t    early termination policy 不能直接信任 raw probabilities，需要 domain-specific threshold\n685\t    tuning。\n686\t\n687\t    '\n688\t- name: Gold Set Power Analysis\n689\t  plan_id: gold-power-analysis\n690\t  description: 计算 N=505 gold set 在 α=0.05, β=0.8 下能检测的最小效应量\n691\t  expected_results:\n692\t    total_n: 505\n693\t    conf1_n: 282\n694\t    conf2_n: 223\n695\t    alpha: 0.05\n696\t    power: 0.8\n697\t    overall_detectable_effect_pp: 8.5\n698\t    conf1_detectable_effect_pp: 11.2\n699\t    conf2_detectable_effect_pp: 12.8\n700\t    pairwise_power_assessment:\n701\t      gb_vs_mv_overall:\n702\t        observed_delta_pp: 4.1\n703\t        power_at_observed_effect: 0.92\n704\t        note: sufficient power — bootstrap p=0.0001 consistent\n705\t      gb_vs_mv_conf1:\n706\t        observed_delta_pp: -2.0\n707\t        power_at_observed_effect: 0.12\n708\t        note: severely underpowered — cannot detect small negative effects\n709\t      gb_vs_probe_overall:\n710\t        observed_delta_pp: 5.0\n711\t        power_at_observed_effect: 0.85\n712\t        note: marginally powered\n713\t      gb_vs_rf_overall:\n714\t        observed_delta_pp: 2.9\n715\t        power_at_observed_effect: 0.41\n716\t        note: underpowered — significant result may be inflated\n717\t      twv_probe_vs_gb:\n718\t        observed_delta_pp: 1.5\n719\t        power_at_observed_effect: 0.15\n720\t        note: severely underpowered — p=0.056 consistent with noise\n721\t    effective_n_after_overlap_correction: 420\n722\t    overlap_penalty_note: stride=1 windows share 4/5 steps, bootstrap independence\n723\t      assumption partially violated\n724\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档假设：gold set 只能检测 >8pp 差异，多数 pairwise tests underpowered。\n725\t\n726\t    N=505 paired bootstrap 在 overall 上可检测 ~8.5pp 差异（α=0.05, 80% power）。\n727\t\n728\t    GB vs MV (+4.1pp) 恰好有足够 power (0.92) 因为 effect 虽小但 variance 也不大。\n729\t\n730\t    但 conf=1 subset (N=282) 能检测的最小 effect 是 11.2pp——远大于观测到的 -2pp delta，\n731\t\n732\t    意味着 conf=1 分析 fundamentally underpowered，不能得出任何结论。\n733\t\n734\t    GB vs RF (+2.9pp) 虽然 bootstrap p=0.0003（显著），但 power 只有 0.41——\n735\t\n736\t    这意味着如果真实 delta 是 2.9pp，我们有 59% 概率 miss 它。显著结果可能因 multiple testing 膨胀。\n737\t\n738\t    窗口重叠（stride=1）进一步降低有效样本量——505 个窗口的有效独立 N 约 420。\n739\t\n740\t    '\n741\t  tables:\n742\t  - name: 'Table: Power Analysis Summary'\n743\t    content: '| Comparison          | N   | Obs Δ (pp) | MDE (pp) | Power | Verdict       |\n744\t\n745\t      |---------------------|-----|-----------|----------|-------|---------------|\n746\t\n747\t      | GB vs MV (overall)  | 505 | +4.1      | 8.5      | 0.92  | Adequate      |\n748\t\n749\t      | GB vs MV (conf=1)   | 282 | -2.0      | 11.2     | 0.12  | Underpowered  |\n750\t\n751\t      | GB vs Probe         | 491 | +5.0      | 8.8      | 0.85  | Marginal      |\n752\t\n753\t      | GB vs RF            | 491 | +2.9      | 8.8      | 0.41  | Underpowered  |\n754\t\n755\t      | TWV-Probe vs GB     | 491 | +1.5      | 8.8      | 0.15  | Underpowered  |\n756\t\n757\t      '\n758\t  figures_description:\n759\t  - 'Power curve: 横轴 effect size (pp), 纵轴 power, 分别画 N=505 / N=282 / N=223 三条线。标注各\n760\t    pairwise comparison 的 observed effect。'\n761\t  analysis: 'Power analysis 诚实暴露了 gold set 的能力边界：只有 GB vs MV overall 和 GB vs Probe\n762\t    有足够 power。\n763\t\n764\t    其他所有 pairwise comparison 都 underpowered。特别是 conf=1 分析（anti-circularity 核心证据）\n765\t\n766\t    完全 underpowered——即使真实 delta 是 +5pp，N=282 也只有 30% 概率检测到。\n767\t\n768\t    论文必须在 Limitations 中明确报告这些 power bounds，不能从 non-significant conf=1 结果\n769\t\n770\t    推断 \"GB = MV on disagreement windows\"。正确解读：conf=1 上的证据 inconclusive。\n771\t\n772\t    '\n773\t- name: Human Ceiling Estimate\n774\t  plan_id: human-ceiling-estimate\n775\t  description: 从 IAA 数据估算 model 可达到的最大性能（given annotator disagreement）\n776\t  expected_results:\n777\t    fleiss_kappa: 0.39\n778\t    pairwise_kappa_range:\n779\t    - 0.33\n780\t    - 0.485\n781\t    annotator_pairwise_agreement_rate: 0.8\n782\t    estimated_ceiling_macro_f1: 0.82\n783\t    estimated_ceiling_f1_stag: 0.78\n784\t    estimated_ceiling_f1_prog: 0.86\n785\t    gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.839\n786\t    gb_vs_ceiling_gap_pp: 1.9\n787\t    gb_exceeds_ceiling: true\n788\t    ceiling_derivation: 'If annotators agree 80% of the time, majority-of-3 gold label\n789\t      accuracy ≈ 92%.\n790\t\n791\t      Best achievable F1 by any model predicting majority-of-3 ≈ 0.82 macro F1\n792\t\n793\t      (accounting for class imbalance and systematic annotation patterns).\n794\t\n795\t      '\n796\t    annotator_error_pattern:\n797\t      B2_B3_lowest_kappa: 0.33\n798\t      most_disagreement_on: transitional windows (stag→prog boundary)\n799\t      progress_bias: B3 labels more windows as progress\n800\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档假设：human ceiling 0.80-0.84，GB 0.839 已达天花板。\n801\t\n802\t    κ=0.39 对应 pairwise agreement ~80%。Majority-of-3 voting 提升有效 agreement 到 ~92%，\n803\t\n804\t    但这意味着 ~8% 的 gold labels 本身就是 \"wrong\"（i.e., 2-1 majority vs 3-0 unanimous 差距）。\n805\t\n806\t    任何模型在这样的 gold 上的理论 F1 上界约 0.82——而 GB 已经 0.839，超出 ceiling 1.9pp。\n807\t\n808\t    这不是说 GB \"超人\"，而是说 GB 碰巧在某些 annotator 分歧的窗口上预测了 majority vote 而非 true answer。\n809\t\n810\t    Implication：所有 gold 上的结论强度都被 annotator disagreement 限制——\n811\t\n812\t    GB 0.839 vs MV 0.798 的 4.1pp 差距中有一部分可能是 noise，无法确定 true improvement 是多少。\n813\t\n814\t    κ=0.39 反映了 stagnation 本身的 definitional ambiguity，不是标注者无能。\n815\t\n816\t    '\n817\t  tables:\n818\t  - name: 'Table: Human Ceiling Estimation'\n819\t    content: '| Metric                         | Value   |\n820\t\n821\t      |--------------------------------|---------|\n822\t\n823\t      | Fleiss κ                        | 0.39    |\n824\t\n825\t      | Pairwise agreement rate         | ~80%    |\n826\t\n827\t      | Majority-of-3 effective accuracy| ~92%    |\n828\t\n829\t      | Estimated model ceiling F1      | 0.82    |\n830\t\n831\t      | GB actual F1 (gold)             | 0.839   |\n832\t\n833\t      | GB - ceiling (pp)               | +1.9    |\n834\t\n835\t      '\n836\t  figures_description:\n837\t  - 'Bar chart: model performances on gold 加 human ceiling 水平线 (F1=0.82)。GB 略超线，其他模型在线下。'\n838\t  analysis: 'GB 超出 human ceiling 有两种解读：(1) 优化——GB 学到了 annotator majority 的 pattern；\n839\t\n840\t    (2) ceiling 估算保守——真实 ceiling 可能略高于 0.82。\n841\t\n842\t    无论哪种，key takeaway 是：0.839 和 0.798 之间的差距（4.1pp）在 ceiling ~0.82 的 context 下\n843\t\n844\t    已经不小了——但也说明任何进一步提升都极为困难。\n845\t\n846\t    论文 reframe κ=0.39：\"stagnation is inherently ambiguous. We provide the first systematic\n847\t\n848\t    quantification of this ambiguity for agent trajectory analysis. The low κ reflects\n849\t\n850\t    the construct''s definitional challenges, not annotation failure.\"\n851\t\n852\t    这把 weakness 转为 contribution——比假装 κ 很高更有学术价值。\n853\t\n854\t    '\n855\t- name: Stride Sensitivity Analysis\n856\t  plan_id: stride-sensitivity\n857\t  description: Window stride ablation (1/3/5)：对 effective sample size 和 model performance\n858\t    的影响\n859\t  expected_results:\n860\t    probe_results:\n861\t      stride_1:\n862\t        macro_f1: 0.9055\n863\t        train_windows: 38161\n864\t        test_windows: 8101\n865\t        effective_n_ratio: 1.0\n866\t      stride_3:\n867\t        macro_f1: 0.893\n868\t        train_windows: 12720\n869\t        test_windows: 2700\n870\t        effective_n_ratio: 0.72\n871\t        delta_vs_s1_pp: -1.3\n872\t      stride_5:\n873\t        macro_f1: 0.878\n874\t        train_windows: 7632\n875\t        test_windows: 1620\n876\t        effective_n_ratio: 0.45\n877\t        delta_vs_s1_pp: -2.8\n878\t    structural_results:\n879\t      stride_1_rf: 0.9951\n880\t      stride_3_rf: 0.993\n881\t      stride_5_rf: 0.99\n882\t    bootstrap_ci_comparison:\n883\t      stride_1_ci_width_pp: 3.2\n884\t      stride_3_ci_width_pp: 4.8\n885\t      stride_5_ci_width_pp: 6.1\n886\t    autocorrelation:\n887\t      stride_1_lag1: 0.89\n888\t      stride_3_lag1: 0.52\n889\t      stride_5_lag1: 0.11\n890\t  result_rationale: 'Stride=1 的窗口共享 4/5 steps（k=5），相邻窗口相关性极高（lag-1 autocorrelation\n891\t    0.89）。\n892\t\n893\t    这不影响 model 训练（更多数据总是有帮助），但影响统计推断——bootstrap CI 基于独立性假设，\n894\t\n895\t    实际 CI 应比报告的更宽。Stride=3 autocorrelation 降到 0.52，stride=5（无重叠）降到 0.11。\n896\t\n897\t    Probe F1 从 stride=1 的 0.906 降到 stride=5 的 0.878 (-2.8pp)——主要是训练数据量减少的影响。\n898\t\n899\t    Structural RF 几乎不受影响（0.995→0.990）——因为 RF 不依赖序列信息且样本足够。\n900\t\n901\t    Key finding：stride=5 的 bootstrap CI 是 stride=1 的 ~2x 宽——某些 \"significant\" 结果可能\n902\t\n903\t    在独立采样下变为 non-significant。不影响主结论但需在 paper 中注明。\n904\t\n905\t    '\n906\t  tables:\n907\t  - name: 'Table: Stride Sensitivity'\n908\t    content: '| Stride | Probe F1 | RF F1  | Train N  | Autocorr (lag-1) | 95% CI\n909\t      width (pp) |\n910\t\n911\t      |--------|----------|--------|----------|------------------|--------------------|\n912\t\n913\t      | 1      | 0.906    | 0.995  | 38,161   | 0.89             | ±1.6               |\n914\t\n915\t      | 3      | 0.893    | 0.993  | 12,720   | 0.52             | ±2.4               |\n916\t\n917\t      | 5      | 0.878    | 0.990  | 7,632    | 0.11             | ±3.1               |\n918\t\n919\t      '\n920\t  figures_description:\n921\t  - 'Line plot: stride vs F1 (probe 和 structural 两条线) + stride vs CI width (secondary\n922\t    y-axis)。'\n923\t  analysis: '主要影响是 statistical precision 而非 model quality。Stride=1 的 CI 可能过于乐观。\n924\t\n925\t    建议论文报告 stride=1 结果但注明 effective sample size 调整，\n926\t\n927\t    在 appendix 提供 stride=5 robustness check。不改变定性结论但增强可信度。\n928\t\n929\t    '\n930\t- name: Feature Importance Figure (SHAP/Permutation)\n931\t  plan_id: feature-importance-figure\n932\t  description: SHAP/permutation importance 分析 structural model，区分 LF-overlap vs residual\n933\t    features\n934\t  expected_results:\n935\t    top_10_features:\n936\t    - name: repeated_cmd_ratio\n937\t      shap_mean: 0.281\n938\t      lf_overlap: true\n939\t      lf: cmd_rep\n940\t    - name: unique_file_edits\n941\t      shap_mean: 0.192\n942\t      lf_overlap: true\n943\t      lf: file_diff\n944\t    - name: action_diversity_index\n945\t      shap_mean: 0.098\n946\t      lf_overlap: partial\n947\t    - name: consecutive_same_action\n948\t      shap_mean: 0.078\n949\t      lf_overlap: true\n950\t      lf: cmd_rep\n951\t    - name: error_count\n952\t      shap_mean: 0.062\n953\t      lf_overlap: false\n954\t    - name: mean_step_tokens\n955\t      shap_mean: 0.048\n956\t      lf_overlap: false\n957\t    - name: file_diff_magnitude\n958\t      shap_mean: 0.041\n959\t      lf_overlap: true\n960\t      lf: file_diff\n961\t    - name: unique_commands\n962\t      shap_mean: 0.038\n963\t      lf_overlap: partial\n964\t    - name: output_length_variance\n965\t      shap_mean: 0.031\n966\t      lf_overlap: false\n967\t    - name: task_outcome_signal\n968\t      shap_mean: 0.028\n969\t      lf_overlap: true\n970\t      lf: outcome_bp\n971\t    lf_overlap_pct_of_total_importance: 72.3\n972\t    non_lf_features_pct: 27.7\n973\t    top2_are_lf_direct: true\n974\t    permutation_importance_correlation_with_shap: 0.94\n975\t  result_rationale: 'Structural model（RF/GB）的输入是 30 个手工特征，其中多个直接对应 LF 的计算逻辑。\n976\t\n977\t    SHAP 分析在 worst 档下显示：top 2 features (repeated_cmd_ratio, unique_file_edits) 直接\n978\t\n979\t    映射到 cmd_rep 和 file_diff LFs，合计占 47.3% 的总 importance。\n980\t\n981\t    Top 10 中有 5 个直接 LF-overlap，占 72.3% importance——这视觉化地证实了 circularity concern。\n982\t\n983\t    Non-LF features（error_count, mean_step_tokens, output_length_variance）确实有贡献（27.7%），\n984\t\n985\t    说明模型学到了一些 beyond-LF 信号，但这些 residual features 不足以独立支撑 \"structural features\n986\t\n987\t    capture something fundamentally different from LF heuristics\" 的 claim。\n988\t\n989\t    Feature-overlap-ablation 实验已显示 11 个 non-overlap features 的 cross-agent F1=0.977\n990\t\n991\t    （仅 +1pp vs 30 features 的 0.967），但这在 worst 档下反而说明 non-overlap features\n992\t\n993\t    也可能在学 LF-correlated signal，只是间接的。\n994\t\n995\t    '\n996\t  tables:\n997\t  - name: 'Table: Top 10 SHAP Feature Importance'\n998\t    content: '| Rank | Feature              | |SHAP| mean | LF Overlap | Cumulative\n999\t      % |\n1000\t\n1001\t      |------|----------------------|-------------|------------|-------------|\n1002\t\n1003\t      | 1    | repeated_cmd_ratio   | 0.281       | cmd_rep    | 28.1%       |\n1004\t\n1005\t      | 2    | unique_file_edits    | 0.192       | file_diff  | 47.3%       |\n1006\t\n1007\t      | 3    | action_diversity     | 0.098       | partial    | 57.1%       |\n1008\t\n1009\t      | 4    | consecutive_same_act | 0.078       | cmd_rep    | 64.9%       |\n1010\t\n1011\t      | 5    | error_count          | 0.062       | none       | 71.1%       |\n1012\t\n1013\t      | 6    | mean_step_tokens     | 0.048       | none       | 75.9%       |\n1014\t\n1015\t      | 7    | file_diff_magnitude  | 0.041       | file_diff  | 80.0%       |\n1016\t\n1017\t      | 8    | unique_commands      | 0.038       | partial    | 83.8%       |\n1018\t\n1019\t      | 9    | output_length_var    | 0.031       | none       | 87.0%       |\n1020\t\n1021\t      | 10   | task_outcome_signal  | 0.028       | outcome_bp | 89.8%       |\n1022\t\n1023\t      '\n1024\t  figures_description:\n1025\t  - 'SHAP beeswarm plot: top 15 features，color-coded by LF overlap (red=direct LF,\n1026\t    orange=partial, blue=non-LF)。'\n1027\t  - 'Stacked bar: total importance 分解为 LF-direct (48%), LF-partial (14%), non-LF (28%),\n1028\t    other (10%)。'\n1029\t  analysis: 'SHAP 图在 worst 档下成为 double-edged sword：视觉化地确认了 structural model 主要在\n1030\t\n1031\t    reverse-engineer LF heuristics（72% importance from LF-overlapping features）。\n1032\t\n1033\t    但也展示了 ~28% 的 non-LF signal——这支持 \"structural features capture more than LFs\" 的弱版\n1034\t    claim。\n1035\t\n1036\t    论文应诚实呈现：structural model ≈ 70% LF reconstruction + 30% residual signal。\n1037\t\n1038\t    The 30% residual explains why GB (0.839) > MV (0.798) on gold: some non-LF features\n1039\t\n1040\t    provide genuine stagnation signal beyond what LFs capture.\n1041\t\n1042\t    '\n1043\t- name: Trajectory Visualization\n1044\t  plan_id: trajectory-visualization\n1045\t  description: 选择代表性轨迹生成 LF activation overlay 图，建立 semantic stagnation 直觉\n1046\t  expected_results:\n1047\t    n_example_trajectories: 4\n1048\t    selected_types:\n1049\t    - clear stagnation tail (all LFs agree)\n1050\t    - semantic stagnation (diverse actions but no progress)\n1051\t    - false positive (looks stagnant but making progress)\n1052\t    - recovery after stagnation\n1053\t    visualization_elements:\n1054\t    - step-by-step action labels (abbreviated)\n1055\t    - LF activation overlay (cmd_rep / file_diff / OB)\n1056\t    - probe prediction confidence band\n1057\t    - structural model prediction\n1058\t    - gold label (where available)\n1059\t  result_rationale: '定性可视化不产生量化 metrics，但对 reviewer 建立直觉至关重要。\n1060\t\n1061\t    在 worst 档下，FP case（false positive）特别重要——展示 agent 在做 diverse edits 但\n1062\t\n1063\t    模型（和 LFs）误判为 stagnation 的情况，帮助 reviewer 理解 error pattern。\n1064\t\n1065\t    Recovery case 支持 \"不是所有 stagnation 都是 terminal\" 的叙事，为 intervention 的谨慎定位提供直觉。\n1066\t\n1067\t    '\n1068\t  tables: []\n1069\t  figures_description:\n1070\t  - '4-panel figure: 每 panel 一条轨迹。横轴=steps，纵轴=stacked LF activations + model confidence。Gold\n1071\t    label 用背景色标注。Caption 解释每个 case 的 stagnation 模式。'\n1072\t  analysis: '可视化不改变定量结论，但帮助 reviewer 理解 \"semantic stagnation\" 为何难以定义（对应 κ=0.39）。\n1073\t\n1074\t    FP case 直接对应 error-analysis 发现（FP dominant, highly confident, mean prob=0.922）。\n1075\t\n1076\t    Recovery case 为 intervention 的谨慎设计提供 motivation——不是所有检测到的 stagnation 都应 terminate。'\n1077\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4efa5a2a-e3e9-4e76-992e-c9082babf060","uuid":"721a3960-c61f-4a6f-8a31-bf1420efd055","timestamp":"2026-05-16T03:29:04.896Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T021904/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '放弃 \"structural dominance\" 作为 primary claim。重构三条主轴：\n\n  (1) Primary → Claim 2 (label quality as transfer bottleneck)：+28pp 标签修复证据最 robust，不受\n  encoder/LLM 对比影响。\n\n  (2) Claim 1 → \"cost-latency-accuracy Pareto advantage\"：<5ms + 零适配 + F1 0.967，不声称\n  signal type superiority，声称 deployment efficiency。\n\n  (3) Claim 4 → \"preliminary evidence\"，移入 discussion。低 waste 比例 + 高误杀率限制 intervention\n  天花板。\n\n  Anti-circularity 唯一证据：整体 gold GB 0.839 > MV 0.798 (p<0.001)。conf=1 分层承认 underpowered\n  且 delta 接近零。\n\n  κ=0.39 reframe：stagnation 本身 definitionally ambiguous，首次量化歧义性比假装高 κ 更诚实更有信息量。\n\n  Human ceiling ~0.82 解释 GB 0.839 为何已 near-optimal——不是模型差，是任务本身的 agreement ceiling。\n\n  TLM negative (Claim 3) 重要性上升，作为 methodological contribution。\n\n  论文类型：从 \"framework paper\" 调为 \"empirical analysis paper with practical deployment\n  guidelines\"。\n\n  目标仍为 EMNLP，projected consensus 3.5-4.0/6。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Compute Waste Audit\n  plan_id: compute-waste-audit\n  description: 回溯分析 SWE-Agent + OpenHands 全量轨迹，量化 stagnation tail 长度及浪费的 token/step\n    占比\n  expected_results:\n    swe_total_trajectories: 543\n    swe_trajectories_with_stag_tail: 231\n    swe_pct_with_tail: 42.5\n    swe_mean_tail_length_windows: 3.8\n    swe_median_tail_length_windows: 2\n    swe_tail_steps_pct_of_total: 19.4\n    swe_tail_tokens_pct_of_total: 16.8\n    oh_total_trajectories: 3409\n    oh_trajectories_with_stag_tail: 1278\n    oh_pct_with_tail: 37.5\n    oh_mean_tail_length_windows: 4.6\n    oh_median_tail_length_windows: 3\n    oh_tail_steps_pct_of_total: 17.1\n    oh_tail_tokens_pct_of_total: 15.3\n    combined_waste_steps_pct: 18.0\n    combined_waste_tokens_pct: 15.9\n    long_tail_ge10_pct_of_tailed: 11.2\n    long_tail_contribution_to_waste: 48.3\n    natural_termination_within_3_windows: 62.4\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：compute waste <25%，多数轨迹在停滞后很快自然终止。\n\n    SWE-Agent stag_rate=28.5% 看似高，但 stagnation 窗口并非集中在轨迹尾部——许多是中段短暂停滞后恢复。\n\n    定义 \"stagnation tail\" 为轨迹末尾连续 stagnation 窗口块。约 40% 的轨迹有 tail，但 median tail 仅 2-3\n    个窗口。\n\n    62% 的 tailed 轨迹在首次尾部停滞后 3 个窗口内自然终止（agent 自己放弃或触发 max-step 限制）。\n\n    Waste 的 80/20 法则：11% 的长尾轨迹（≥10 windows tail）贡献了近 50% 的浪费。大部分轨迹尾部很短，\n\n    early termination 的收益被\"本来也很快就结束\"的事实压缩。整体浪费 ~18% steps / ~16% tokens。\n\n    OH 的浪费略低于 SWE，因为 OH 轨迹整体更长但 stagnation tail 比例相对更小。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Stagnation Tail Statistics by Agent'\n    content: '| Agent     | Trajectories | With Tail | % Tailed | Mean Tail (win)\n      | Median | Waste (steps%) | Waste (tokens%) |\n\n      |-----------|-------------|-----------|----------|-----------------|--------|----------------|-----------------|\n\n      | SWE-Agent | 543         | 231       | 42.5%    | 3.8             | 2      |\n      19.4%          | 16.8%           |\n\n      | OpenHands | 3409        | 1278      | 37.5%    | 4.6             | 3      |\n      17.1%          | 15.3%           |\n\n      | Combined  | 3952        | 1509      | 38.2%    | 4.4             | 3      |\n      18.0%          | 15.9%           |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Histogram: stagnation tail length distribution (窗口数)，双峰分布——大量 tail=1-2 短尾 + 少量\n    tail>10 长尾。标注 median 和 90th percentile。'\n  - 'Stacked bar: 每条轨迹的 steps 分解为 progress / mid-stagnation / stagnation-tail，按 tail\n    长度排序。展示浪费集中在少数长尾轨迹。'\n  analysis: '18% waste 是 intervention 故事的天花板——即使完美检测 + 即时终止，也只能省 18%。\n\n    实际 early termination 必须等待连续 k 个 stagnation 窗口确认，因此实际节省 < 18%。\n\n    大部分浪费集中在少数长尾轨迹（~11% of tailed trajectories contribute ~48% waste），\n\n    意味着 intervention 的边际收益递减很快。叙事调整：不声称 \"大规模计算节省\"，\n\n    改为 \"for the subset of trajectories with extended stagnation tails (X%), early\n    termination saves Y%\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Early Termination Simulation\n  plan_id: early-termination-simulation\n  description: 模拟不同连续停滞阈值的 early stopping policy，量化 precision/recall/savings/task\n    success trade-off\n  expected_results:\n    threshold_k1:\n      precision: 0.58\n      recall: 0.94\n      compute_saved_pct: 16.2\n      task_success_preserved_pct: 74.8\n      false_kill_rate: 0.42\n    threshold_k2:\n      precision: 0.67\n      recall: 0.88\n      compute_saved_pct: 14.7\n      task_success_preserved_pct: 79.3\n      false_kill_rate: 0.33\n    threshold_k3:\n      precision: 0.74\n      recall: 0.79\n      compute_saved_pct: 13.1\n      task_success_preserved_pct: 83.4\n      false_kill_rate: 0.26\n    threshold_k5:\n      precision: 0.83\n      recall: 0.61\n      compute_saved_pct: 10.2\n      task_success_preserved_pct: 87.1\n      false_kill_rate: 0.17\n    threshold_k7:\n      precision: 0.89\n      recall: 0.44\n      compute_saved_pct: 7.6\n      task_success_preserved_pct: 91.2\n      false_kill_rate: 0.11\n    best_operating_point_k: 3\n    best_compute_saved_pct: 13.1\n    best_task_success_preserved_pct: 83.4\n    oracle_compute_saved_pct: 18.0\n    random_baseline_efficiency: 0.52\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档假设：early termination 节省有限 (10-20%) 且误杀率高 (task success\n    <88%)。\n\n    k=1 过于激进：单个 stagnation 窗口就终止，误杀 42% 的实际 making-progress 轨迹。\n\n    问题在于 stagnation 标签的 recall 瓶颈（conf=2 上 recall_stag 仅 0.77）——模型自信但错误地\n\n    预测 stagnation 的 FP 案例 (error-analysis: FP 65%, mean prob=0.922) 直接转化为误杀。\n\n    k=3 是 sweet spot 但 trade-off 仍不理想：节省 13% compute（远低于 18% oracle ceiling），\n\n    保留 83% task success（意味着 17% 的原本可解决任务被错误终止）。\n\n    k≥5 误杀率低但 recall 骤降——大部分短尾轨迹（median tail=2-3 windows）在 k=5 确认前已自然终止。\n\n    核心问题：stagnation tail 短 + 检测器 FP confident = intervention 价值有限。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Early Termination Threshold Sweep'\n    content: '| k | Precision | Recall | Compute Saved (%) | Task Success (%) | False\n      Kill Rate |\n\n      |---|-----------|--------|-------------------|------------------|-----------------|\n\n      | 1 | 0.58      | 0.94   | 16.2              | 74.8             | 0.42            |\n\n      | 2 | 0.67      | 0.88   | 14.7              | 79.3             | 0.33            |\n\n      | 3 | 0.74      | 0.79   | 13.1              | 83.4             | 0.26            |\n\n      | 5 | 0.83      | 0.61   | 10.2              | 87.1             | 0.17            |\n\n      | 7 | 0.89      | 0.44   | 7.6               | 91.2             | 0.11            |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Precision-Recall curve: 不同 k 阈值下的 PR 曲线，标注每个 k 的 operating point。'\n  analysis: 'Best operating point (k=3) 节省 13% compute 但损失 17% task success——对工业部署而言\n    risk-reward 不够好。\n\n    论文需降级 Claim 4：从 \"compute-efficient intervention\" 降为 \"preliminary evidence that\n    early termination\n\n    is feasible for the subset of trajectories with extended stagnation\"。\n\n    强调 structural detector 的低延迟 (<5ms) 是部署 intervention 的前提条件（LLM judge 不可能做实时 termination），\n\n    但不声称当前 trade-off 已经 production-ready。\n\n    '\n- name: Cost-Effectiveness Pareto Curve\n  plan_id: cost-effectiveness-pareto\n  description: Pareto 前沿：compute saved vs task success preserved，structural vs oracle\n    vs random\n  expected_results:\n    pareto_points_structural:\n    - compute_saved_pct: 16.2\n      task_success_pct: 74.8\n      k: 1\n    - compute_saved_pct: 14.7\n      task_success_pct: 79.3\n      k: 2\n    - compute_saved_pct: 13.1\n      task_success_pct: 83.4\n      k: 3\n    - compute_saved_pct: 10.2\n      task_success_pct: 87.1\n      k: 5\n    - compute_saved_pct: 7.6\n      task_success_pct: 91.2\n      k: 7\n    oracle_point:\n      compute_saved_pct: 18.0\n      task_success_pct: 100.0\n    random_policy_auc: 0.52\n    structural_policy_auc: 0.71\n    oracle_auc: 1.0\n    structural_vs_oracle_efficiency: 0.71\n  result_rationale: 'Oracle ceiling 仅 18% compute saved（因 waste 本身就低），structural detector\n    Pareto 前沿在 oracle 下方。\n\n    Random baseline AUC=0.52（对角线附近），structural AUC=0.71——比 random 好但远非 oracle。\n\n    关键视觉信息：oracle 和 structural 曲线之间的 gap 来自 detector FP（confident 但错误的 stagnation\n    预测）。\n\n    低 oracle ceiling + detector imperfection = intervention 的实用空间被双重压缩。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Pareto plot: 横轴 compute saved (%), 纵轴 task success preserved (%)。三条曲线：oracle\n    (flat at 100% then drop), structural (concave), random (diagonal)。标注各 k 值的 operating\n    point。Oracle ceiling 18% 用虚线标注。'\n  analysis: '图的核心 message：intervention 的绝对天花板有限（最多省 18%），且检测器无法完全到达天花板。\n\n    在 worst 档下，这张图从 \"compelling deployment story\" 降级为 \"proof of concept\"。\n\n    论文应诚实呈现：intervention 对少数长尾轨迹有价值，但不是 general-purpose compute saver。\n\n    Pareto 图仍有学术价值——建立了从 detection 到 intervention 的方法论桥梁，为未来更好的检测器设定 benchmark。\n\n    '\n- name: LLM-as-Judge on OpenHands\n  plan_id: llm-on-oh\n  description: 在 OH 轨迹上运行 LLM judge 全套 variants，与 structural GB 做 matched cross-agent\n    对比\n  expected_results:\n    oh_subset_n: 2000\n    claude_zeroshot:\n      macro_f1: 0.793\n      f1_stag: 0.748\n      f1_prog: 0.838\n      cost_usd: 14.2\n      parse_failures: 3\n    claude_fewshot:\n      macro_f1: 0.836\n      f1_stag: 0.802\n      f1_prog: 0.87\n      cost_usd: 42.6\n      parse_failures: 0\n    claude_cot:\n      macro_f1: 0.841\n      f1_stag: 0.811\n      f1_prog: 0.871\n      cost_usd: 19.5\n      parse_failures: 1\n    claude_fewshot_cot:\n      macro_f1: 0.872\n      f1_stag: 0.843\n      f1_prog: 0.901\n      cost_usd: 47.3\n      parse_failures: 0\n    gpt55_zeroshot:\n      macro_f1: 0.824\n      f1_stag: 0.789\n      f1_prog: 0.859\n      parse_failures: 187\n      parse_failure_rate: 0.094\n      cost_usd: 13.8\n    best_llm_variant: claude_fewshot_cot\n    best_llm_macro_f1: 0.872\n    structural_gb_oh_all_macro_f1: 0.967\n    structural_vs_best_llm_gap_pp: 9.5\n    swe_best_llm_macro_f1: 0.799\n    oh_vs_swe_llm_improvement_pp: 7.3\n    total_cost_usd: 137.4\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：LLM 在 OH 上 F1 0.82-0.90，gap 缩至 7-15pp。\n\n    OH 轨迹比 SWE 更结构化（OpenHands 使用更规范的 action space 和更清晰的 step boundary），\n\n    LLM 更容易从文本中判断 progress vs stagnation。SWE-Agent 轨迹中有大量 shell output noise\n\n    和 file content dump，干扰 LLM 判断；OH 轨迹更干净。\n\n    Claude few-shot-CoT 在 SWE 上 0.799，在 OH 上跳到 0.872 (+7.3pp)——显示 LLM 性能高度 task-dependent。\n\n    GPT-5.5 zero-shot在 OH 上 0.824（超过 Claude SWE few-shot 0.751），进一步确认 OH 对 LLM 更友好。\n\n    Gap 从 16.8pp (SWE) 缩小到 9.5pp (OH)——structural 仍然更好，但 \"dominance\" 需要 reframe。\n\n    LLM 的优势：不需要任何训练数据，适用于任何 agent；劣势：$47/2000 windows = $3500+/full OH dataset + 高延迟。\n\n    这使得 headline comparison 从 \"structural >> LLM (+16.8pp)\" 变为 \"structural > LLM (+9.5pp)\n    at 1000x lower cost\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: LLM Judge Variants on OpenHands (N=2000)'\n    content: '| Method                | Macro F1 | F1_stag | F1_prog | Cost ($) |\n      Gap vs Struct (pp) |\n\n      |-----------------------|----------|---------|---------|----------|--------------------|\n\n      | Claude zero-shot      | 0.793    | 0.748   | 0.838   | 14.20    | -17.4              |\n\n      | Claude few-shot       | 0.836    | 0.802   | 0.870   | 42.60    | -13.1              |\n\n      | Claude CoT            | 0.841    | 0.811   | 0.871   | 19.50    | -12.6              |\n\n      | Claude few-shot-CoT   | 0.872    | 0.843   | 0.901   | 47.30    | -9.5               |\n\n      | GPT-5.5 zero-shot     | 0.824    | 0.789   | 0.859   | 13.80    | -14.3              |\n\n      | Structural GB (ref)   | 0.967    | 0.948   | 0.987   | ~0       | —                  |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: SWE vs OH 上各方法 F1 对比，双组柱状图。展示 LLM 在 OH 上系统性提升 + gap 缩小。'\n  analysis: 'Gap 缩小到 9.5pp 意味着 \"structural >> LLM\" 的叙事不再成立。\n\n    Reframe 为三维 Pareto：cost ($0 vs $47) × latency (<5ms vs ~2s) × accuracy (0.967\n    vs 0.872)。\n\n    Structural 在所有三个维度上都更优或持平——这是 deployment efficiency story，不是 signal superiority\n    story。\n\n    对 EMNLP reviewer：9.5pp 差距在统计上显著（bootstrap 可确认），但实用差距变小——\n\n    reviewer 可能认为 \"LLM only 10pp behind and improving fast\" 削弱了核心贡献。\n\n    应对：强调零数据部署 + 实时推理两个 LLM 无法匹配的属性。\n\n    '\n- name: Conf=1 Gold Error Decomposition\n  plan_id: conf1-gold-error-decomposition\n  description: 在 282 个 conf=1 gold 窗口上分解 GB-correct-MV-wrong / both-wrong / GB-wrong-MV-correct\n  expected_results:\n    conf1_gold_n: 282\n    gold_label_dist_stag: 118\n    gold_label_dist_prog: 164\n    gb_macro_f1: 0.66\n    gb_accuracy: 0.69\n    gb_f1_stag: 0.59\n    gb_f1_prog: 0.73\n    mv_accuracy: 0.71\n    mv_f1_proxy: 0.68\n    gb_minus_mv_accuracy_delta_pp: -2.0\n    decomposition:\n      gb_correct_mv_correct: 152\n      gb_correct_mv_wrong: 43\n      gb_wrong_mv_correct: 49\n      gb_wrong_mv_wrong: 38\n    gb_correct_mv_wrong_pct: 15.2\n    gb_wrong_mv_correct_pct: 17.4\n    net_gb_advantage_windows: -6\n    net_gb_advantage_pct: -2.1\n    bootstrap_delta_ci95:\n    - -8.2\n    - 3.9\n    bootstrap_p: 0.31\n    gb_error_by_gold_label:\n      on_gold_stag:\n        precision: 0.62\n        recall: 0.57\n      on_gold_prog:\n        precision: 0.74\n        recall: 0.78\n  result_rationale: \"Worst 档核心假设：conf=1 gold 上 GB ≈ MV 或 GB 更差，delta <1pp 或为负。\\nConf=1\\\n    \\ 窗口是 LFs 意见分歧的——恰好是 MV 标签最不可靠的区域。在这些窗口上：\\n(a) GB 训练时这些窗口被 downweight（conf=1 不参与\\\n    \\ conf≥2 训练集），模型从未专门优化过这个分布；\\n(b) MV 在 conf=1 上其实有 base rate advantage——如果 2/3\\\n    \\ LFs 说 progress，MV=progress，\\n    且由于 progress 是多数类（stag_rate ~28%），MV 的 progress\\\n    \\ 猜测经常碰对；\\n(c) GB 在 conf=1 上依赖从 conf≥2 训练数据学到的决策边界，但 conf=1 的特征分布与 conf≥2 不同\\n\\\n    \\   （更模糊、更多 edge case），导致 transfer 降级。\\nDecomposition 显示 GB-correct-MV-wrong (43)\\\n    \\ 与 GB-wrong-MV-correct (49) 几乎持平，净差 -6 窗口。\\nBootstrap p=0.31 完全不显著——不能拒绝 \\\"GB\\\n    \\ 和 MV 在 conf=1 上等效\\\" 的零假设。\\n这彻底摧毁了 \\\"model learns soft decision boundaries beyond\\\n    \\ LF heuristics\\\" 的 claim。\\n模型在 LFs 失效的地方也失效了——anti-circularity 的核心证据链断裂。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Error Decomposition on Conf=1 Gold Windows (N=282)'\n    content: '|                    | MV Correct | MV Wrong |\n\n      |--------------------|-----------|----------|\n\n      | **GB Correct**     | 152 (53.9%)| 43 (15.2%)|\n\n      | **GB Wrong**       | 49 (17.4%) | 38 (13.5%)|\n\n      Net GB advantage: -6 windows (-2.1%), p=0.31 (n.s.)\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Conf-Stratified Gold Performance'\n    content: '| Confidence | N   | GB F1 | MV Acc | GB-MV Δ (pp) | p-value |\n\n      |-----------|-----|-------|--------|--------------|---------|\n\n      | conf=1    | 282 | 0.66  | 0.71   | -2.0         | 0.31    |\n\n      | conf≥2    | 223 | 0.87  | 0.83   | +4.0         | 0.003   |\n\n      | Overall   | 505 | 0.839 | 0.798  | +4.1         | 0.0001  |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar: conf=1 vs conf≥2 的 error decomposition 四象限分布对比，视觉化展示 conf=1 上 GB\n    优势消失。'\n  analysis: '整体 gold GB 0.839 > MV 0.798 的优势完全来自 conf≥2 子集（223 windows, Δ=+4pp, p=0.003）。\n\n    Conf=1（282 windows）上 GB 与 MV 等效甚至略差——\"beyond-LF soft decision boundary\" claim\n    不成立。\n\n    Reframe：GB 在 LFs 一致时做得好（trivially——学会了 LF 逻辑），在 LFs 分歧时不比 MV 更好。\n\n    Anti-circularity 退守为：整体 gold GB > MV (p<0.001) 证明模型至少不比投票差，\n\n    加上 human ceiling 论证（annotators 自己也只 agree ~80%）解释为什么 conf=1 上谁都做不好。\n\n    '\n- name: BGE-M3 Probe Zero-Shot Cross-Agent Transfer\n  plan_id: cross-agent-probe-bge\n  description: BGE-M3 probe 在 OH 上 zero-shot 迁移，测试 +39.4pp gap 是否 encoder-dependent\n  expected_results:\n    encoder: BGE-M3\n    bge_indomain_swe_macro_f1: 0.9413\n    bge_zeroshot_oh_all_macro_f1: 0.78\n    bge_zeroshot_oh_all_f1_stag: 0.69\n    bge_zeroshot_oh_all_f1_prog: 0.87\n    bge_zeroshot_oh_conf2_macro_f1: 0.82\n    bge_zeroshot_oh_conf2_f1_stag: 0.74\n    bge_zeroshot_oh_conf2_f1_prog: 0.9\n    qwen_zeroshot_oh_all_macro_f1: 0.5984\n    gap_bge_vs_qwen_pp: 18.2\n    structural_gb_oh_all: 0.9674\n    structural_vs_bge_zeroshot_gap_pp: 18.7\n    structural_vs_qwen_zeroshot_gap_pp: 36.9\n    gap_reduction_pct: 49.3\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档假设：BGE probe zero-shot 达到 0.72-0.82，gap 缩至 <20pp。\n\n    BGE-M3 是多语言/多任务 encoder，representation 更通用。Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B 参数更少且\n\n    训练目标不同——其 zero-shot 0.598 可能部分反映了 encoder 质量而非 stagnation signal 的不可迁移性。\n\n    BGE 的更强 representation 可以更好地编码 agent 行为的语义相似性（即使跨 agent），\n\n    零样本从 0.598 跳到 0.78 (+18.2pp)。这意味着 ~50% 的 \"structural advantage\" 其实是 encoder choice\n    问题。\n\n    结构特征仍领先 18.7pp，但叙事从 \"probe fundamentally fails at zero-shot\" 变为\n\n    \"stronger encoders close half the gap, structural advantage is partially deployment\n    convenience\"。\n\n    BGE 在 conf≥2 上 0.82（高于 all 的 0.78）——conf≥2 标签更干净，probe 从中受益更多。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Encoder Comparison — Zero-Shot Cross-Agent on OH'\n    content: '| Encoder             | In-domain F1 | OH Zero-shot F1 | OH conf≥2 F1\n      | Gap vs Struct (pp) |\n\n      |---------------------|-------------|-----------------|-------------|-------------------|\n\n      | Qwen3-0.6B (orig)   | 0.906       | 0.598           | 0.532*      | -36.9             |\n\n      | BGE-M3              | 0.941       | 0.780           | 0.820       | -18.7             |\n\n      | E5-large-v2         | 0.936       | 0.720           | 0.760       | -24.7             |\n\n      | Structural GB (ref) | 0.995†      | 0.967           | 0.992       | —                 |\n\n      † circular eval caveat   * old labels\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar: 三个 encoder 的 in-domain vs zero-shot cross-agent 对比，加 structural\n    baseline 虚线。'\n  analysis: 'Gap 从 36.9pp 缩至 18.7pp（BGE）——\"structural dominance\" claim 的 headline\n    number 需大幅修正。\n\n    不能再说 \"+39.4pp gap\"（那是 Qwen-specific），需改为 \"structural outperforms best zero-shot\n    probe by 18.7pp\"。\n\n    Reframe 论点：structural advantage 是 encoder-agnostic 的（18.7pp 仍然大且显著），但幅度取决于 encoder\n    质量。\n\n    关键 reviewer 反驳：\"如果用更大的 encoder（e.g., 7B）差距会不会继续缩小？\" ——\n\n    需要在 limitations 中承认，但同时指出更大 encoder = 更高 inference cost，拉回 deployment efficiency\n    叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: E5-large Probe Zero-Shot Cross-Agent Transfer\n  plan_id: cross-agent-probe-e5\n  description: E5-large-v2 probe 在 OH 上 zero-shot 迁移，第二个 encoder 验证\n  expected_results:\n    encoder: E5-large-v2\n    e5_indomain_swe_macro_f1: 0.9363\n    e5_zeroshot_oh_all_macro_f1: 0.72\n    e5_zeroshot_oh_all_f1_stag: 0.62\n    e5_zeroshot_oh_all_f1_prog: 0.82\n    e5_zeroshot_oh_conf2_macro_f1: 0.76\n    e5_zeroshot_oh_conf2_f1_stag: 0.67\n    e5_zeroshot_oh_conf2_f1_prog: 0.85\n    gap_e5_vs_qwen_pp: 12.2\n    structural_vs_e5_zeroshot_gap_pp: 24.7\n  result_rationale: 'E5-large-v2 零样本迁移 0.72，比 Qwen 的 0.598 好 12.2pp 但不如 BGE 的 0.78。\n\n    E5 是单语言 encoder (English-only)，representation 质量介于 Qwen 和 BGE 之间。\n\n    Gap 24.7pp 仍然大——确认 structural advantage 不完全是 encoder 问题，但 encoder 确实是影响因素。\n\n    三个 encoder 的零样本 F1 排序 (0.598 < 0.72 < 0.78) 与其在 standard NLP benchmarks 上的排名一致，\n\n    暗示 \"更好的通用 encoder = 更好的零样本迁移\"，这对 structural features 的叙事不利。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '三 encoder 数据点建立了 encoder quality → zero-shot transfer 的正相关。\n\n    论文需诚实呈现：structural advantage 的一部分来自 \"我们选的 encoder 不够强\"。\n\n    但核心论点可以保留：即使最好的 encoder (BGE) 也落后 18.7pp，\n\n    且 probe 需要 ~10% 目标域数据才能接近 structural（BGE 10% FT 约 0.92 vs structural 0.967 = 4.7pp\n    gap）。\n\n    '\n- name: 2-LF Coverage Analysis\n  plan_id: 2lf-coverage-analysis\n  description: 精确量化 2-LF config 在 OH 上的 conf≥2 覆盖率及 deployment coverage gap\n  expected_results:\n    swe_3lf_conf2_windows: 15401\n    swe_2lf_conf2_windows: 10243\n    swe_2lf_coverage_of_3lf_pct: 66.5\n    oh_total_windows: 150652\n    oh_3lf_conf2_windows: 43376\n    oh_2lf_conf2_windows: 4017\n    oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_of_total_pct: 2.7\n    oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_of_3lf_pct: 9.3\n    oh_2lf_conf1_windows: 72554\n    oh_2lf_any_label_windows: 76571\n    oh_2lf_any_coverage_pct: 50.8\n    oh_no_label_windows: 74081\n    oh_no_label_pct: 49.2\n    deployment_scenarios:\n      conf2_only:\n        coverage_pct: 2.7\n        expected_f1: 0.978\n        note: high precision, near-zero coverage\n      conf1_included:\n        coverage_pct: 50.8\n        expected_f1_upper: 0.92\n        expected_f1_lower: 0.85\n        note: moderate coverage, noisier labels\n      full_prediction:\n        coverage_pct: 100\n        method: model predicts on all windows regardless of LF coverage\n        expected_f1_cross_agent: 0.66\n        note: 'RF cross-agent 2-LF: 0.78 all, but training data limited'\n  result_rationale: '2-LF config 在 SWE 上 coverage 还行（66.5% of 3-LF conf≥2），但在 OH 上崩塌到\n    2.7%。\n\n    原因：OH 上 cmd_rep 仅 fire 5.4%（vs SWE ~65%），移除 OB 后仅剩 file_diff + cmd_rep，\n\n    两者都 fire 的窗口极少。OH 的 action space 不同——更少 command repetition。\n\n    这对 \"2-LF deployable config\" claim 是致命打击：在目标域 (OH) 上几乎没有高置信标签。\n\n    Deployment 场景分析：(a) 只用 conf≥2 = 2.7% 覆盖率，等于没部署；\n\n    (b) 包含 conf=1 = 50.8% 但标签噪声大；(c) 全量预测需模型泛化到无 LF 覆盖区域。\n\n    E1-2lf-crossagent 已显示 2-LF RF 在 conf≥2 仅 -1.8pp，但那是在有 coverage 的极少窗口上。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 2-LF Coverage by Agent and Confidence'\n    content: '| Setting            | SWE-Agent    | OpenHands    |\n\n      |--------------------|-------------|-------------|\n\n      | 3-LF conf≥2       | 15,401      | 43,376      |\n\n      | 2-LF conf≥2       | 10,243 (66.5%)| 4,017 (9.3%)|\n\n      | 2-LF conf≥1       | —           | 76,571 (50.8%)|\n\n      | No LF coverage    | —           | 74,081 (49.2%)|\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Pie chart pair: SWE vs OH 的 2-LF coverage 分布（conf≥2 / conf=1 / no coverage），视觉化\n    coverage 崩塌。'\n  analysis: '2-LF \"deployable config\" 在 OH 上几乎不可部署。0.978 F1 是在 2.7% coverage 上的——\n\n    统计上对但实际无用。论文需修改 2-LF 叙事：不声称 \"deployable without OB\"，\n\n    改为 \"2-LF 在 LF overlap 区域 label consistent，但 coverage 高度 agent-dependent，\n\n    real deployment needs LF adaptation or supplementary labeling sources\"。\n\n    这进一步支持 Claim 2（label quality/coverage as bottleneck）作为更 robust 的主 claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Calibration Analysis\n  plan_id: calibration-analysis\n  description: Reliability diagrams + ECE for GB/RF on silver and gold\n  expected_results:\n    gb_silver:\n      ece_raw: 0.061\n      ece_tempcal: 0.045\n      brier_raw: 0.063\n      brier_tempcal: 0.059\n      temperature: 2.06\n      bimodal_gt09_pct: 64.4\n      bimodal_lt01_pct: 21.7\n    gb_gold:\n      ece_raw: 0.118\n      ece_tempcal: 0.058\n      brier_raw: 0.142\n      brier_tempcal: 0.121\n      temperature: 2.85\n    rf_silver:\n      ece_raw: 0.042\n      ece_tempcal: 0.038\n    rf_gold:\n      ece_raw: 0.097\n      ece_tempcal: 0.052\n    mid_range_overconfident: true\n    mid_range_04_07_confidence_vs_actual: 45-63% conf vs 12-23% actual\n  result_rationale: 'Registry 已有 silver 数据（ECE tempcal 0.0451）。Gold 上 calibration\n    会更差因为：\n\n    (a) 模型在 silver labels 上训练——对 silver 天然 well-calibrated；\n\n    (b) gold labels 代表 human judgment，与 silver 有 ~20% divergence；\n\n    (c) 模型输出高度 bimodal（64% >0.9, 22% <0.1），中间区间严重 overconfident。\n\n    Temperature scaling 部分缓解（ECE 降 25%），但 gold 上 ECE 仍 ~0.058——\n\n    在 worst 档范围 [0.04, 0.06] 的上端。这限制了模型概率输出作为 confidence score 的可靠性，\n\n    对 deployment（尤其是 early termination threshold 设置）有直接影响。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Calibration Metrics'\n    content: '| Model | Eval Set | ECE (raw) | ECE (temp) | Brier (raw) | Temperature\n      |\n\n      |-------|----------|-----------|------------|-------------|-------------|\n\n      | GB    | Silver   | 0.061     | 0.045      | 0.063       | 2.06        |\n\n      | GB    | Gold     | 0.118     | 0.058      | 0.142       | 2.85        |\n\n      | RF    | Silver   | 0.042     | 0.038      | —           | —           |\n\n      | RF    | Gold     | 0.097     | 0.052      | —           | —           |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Reliability diagram 2×2: GB/RF × Silver/Gold。对角线=perfect calibration，bar=actual。展示\n    mid-range overconfidence 和 gold 上 calibration 降级。'\n  analysis: 'Silver 上 ECE 0.045 (tempcal) 在 acceptable 范围，但 gold 上跳到 0.058——\n\n    说明模型对 silver labels 过拟合了 calibration。对 deployment claim：\n\n    模型说 \"90% 确信是 stagnation\" 时在 gold 上实际只有 ~78% 准确——\n\n    early termination policy 不能直接信任 raw probabilities，需要 domain-specific threshold\n    tuning。\n\n    '\n- name: Gold Set Power Analysis\n  plan_id: gold-power-analysis\n  description: 计算 N=505 gold set 在 α=0.05, β=0.8 下能检测的最小效应量\n  expected_results:\n    total_n: 505\n    conf1_n: 282\n    conf2_n: 223\n    alpha: 0.05\n    power: 0.8\n    overall_detectable_effect_pp: 8.5\n    conf1_detectable_effect_pp: 11.2\n    conf2_detectable_effect_pp: 12.8\n    pairwise_power_assessment:\n      gb_vs_mv_overall:\n        observed_delta_pp: 4.1\n        power_at_observed_effect: 0.92\n        note: sufficient power — bootstrap p=0.0001 consistent\n      gb_vs_mv_conf1:\n        observed_delta_pp: -2.0\n        power_at_observed_effect: 0.12\n        note: severely underpowered — cannot detect small negative effects\n      gb_vs_probe_overall:\n        observed_delta_pp: 5.0\n        power_at_observed_effect: 0.85\n        note: marginally powered\n      gb_vs_rf_overall:\n        observed_delta_pp: 2.9\n        power_at_observed_effect: 0.41\n        note: underpowered — significant result may be inflated\n      twv_probe_vs_gb:\n        observed_delta_pp: 1.5\n        power_at_observed_effect: 0.15\n        note: severely underpowered — p=0.056 consistent with noise\n    effective_n_after_overlap_correction: 420\n    overlap_penalty_note: stride=1 windows share 4/5 steps, bootstrap independence\n      assumption partially violated\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档假设：gold set 只能检测 >8pp 差异，多数 pairwise tests underpowered。\n\n    N=505 paired bootstrap 在 overall 上可检测 ~8.5pp 差异（α=0.05, 80% power）。\n\n    GB vs MV (+4.1pp) 恰好有足够 power (0.92) 因为 effect 虽小但 variance 也不大。\n\n    但 conf=1 subset (N=282) 能检测的最小 effect 是 11.2pp——远大于观测到的 -2pp delta，\n\n    意味着 conf=1 分析 fundamentally underpowered，不能得出任何结论。\n\n    GB vs RF (+2.9pp) 虽然 bootstrap p=0.0003（显著），但 power 只有 0.41——\n\n    这意味着如果真实 delta 是 2.9pp，我们有 59% 概率 miss 它。显著结果可能因 multiple testing 膨胀。\n\n    窗口重叠（stride=1）进一步降低有效样本量——505 个窗口的有效独立 N 约 420。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Power Analysis Summary'\n    content: '| Comparison          | N   | Obs Δ (pp) | MDE (pp) | Power | Verdict       |\n\n      |---------------------|-----|-----------|----------|-------|---------------|\n\n      | GB vs MV (overall)  | 505 | +4.1      | 8.5      | 0.92  | Adequate      |\n\n      | GB vs MV (conf=1)   | 282 | -2.0      | 11.2     | 0.12  | Underpowered  |\n\n      | GB vs Probe         | 491 | +5.0      | 8.8      | 0.85  | Marginal      |\n\n      | GB vs RF            | 491 | +2.9      | 8.8      | 0.41  | Underpowered  |\n\n      | TWV-Probe vs GB     | 491 | +1.5      | 8.8      | 0.15  | Underpowered  |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Power curve: 横轴 effect size (pp), 纵轴 power, 分别画 N=505 / N=282 / N=223 三条线。标注各\n    pairwise comparison 的 observed effect。'\n  analysis: 'Power analysis 诚实暴露了 gold set 的能力边界：只有 GB vs MV overall 和 GB vs Probe\n    有足够 power。\n\n    其他所有 pairwise comparison 都 underpowered。特别是 conf=1 分析（anti-circularity 核心证据）\n\n    完全 underpowered——即使真实 delta 是 +5pp，N=282 也只有 30% 概率检测到。\n\n    论文必须在 Limitations 中明确报告这些 power bounds，不能从 non-significant conf=1 结果\n\n    推断 \"GB = MV on disagreement windows\"。正确解读：conf=1 上的证据 inconclusive。\n\n    '\n- name: Human Ceiling Estimate\n  plan_id: human-ceiling-estimate\n  description: 从 IAA 数据估算 model 可达到的最大性能（given annotator disagreement）\n  expected_results:\n    fleiss_kappa: 0.39\n    pairwise_kappa_range:\n    - 0.33\n    - 0.485\n    annotator_pairwise_agreement_rate: 0.8\n    estimated_ceiling_macro_f1: 0.82\n    estimated_ceiling_f1_stag: 0.78\n    estimated_ceiling_f1_prog: 0.86\n    gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.839\n    gb_vs_ceiling_gap_pp: 1.9\n    gb_exceeds_ceiling: true\n    ceiling_derivation: 'If annotators agree 80% of the time, majority-of-3 gold label\n      accuracy ≈ 92%.\n\n      Best achievable F1 by any model predicting majority-of-3 ≈ 0.82 macro F1\n\n      (accounting for class imbalance and systematic annotation patterns).\n\n      '\n    annotator_error_pattern:\n      B2_B3_lowest_kappa: 0.33\n      most_disagreement_on: transitional windows (stag→prog boundary)\n      progress_bias: B3 labels more windows as progress\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档假设：human ceiling 0.80-0.84，GB 0.839 已达天花板。\n\n    κ=0.39 对应 pairwise agreement ~80%。Majority-of-3 voting 提升有效 agreement 到 ~92%，\n\n    但这意味着 ~8% 的 gold labels 本身就是 \"wrong\"（i.e., 2-1 majority vs 3-0 unanimous 差距）。\n\n    任何模型在这样的 gold 上的理论 F1 上界约 0.82——而 GB 已经 0.839，超出 ceiling 1.9pp。\n\n    这不是说 GB \"超人\"，而是说 GB 碰巧在某些 annotator 分歧的窗口上预测了 majority vote 而非 true answer。\n\n    Implication：所有 gold 上的结论强度都被 annotator disagreement 限制——\n\n    GB 0.839 vs MV 0.798 的 4.1pp 差距中有一部分可能是 noise，无法确定 true improvement 是多少。\n\n    κ=0.39 反映了 stagnation 本身的 definitional ambiguity，不是标注者无能。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Human Ceiling Estimation'\n    content: '| Metric                         | Value   |\n\n      |--------------------------------|---------|\n\n      | Fleiss κ                        | 0.39    |\n\n      | Pairwise agreement rate         | ~80%    |\n\n      | Majority-of-3 effective accuracy| ~92%    |\n\n      | Estimated model ceiling F1      | 0.82    |\n\n      | GB actual F1 (gold)             | 0.839   |\n\n      | GB - ceiling (pp)               | +1.9    |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: model performances on gold 加 human ceiling 水平线 (F1=0.82)。GB 略超线，其他模型在线下。'\n  analysis: 'GB 超出 human ceiling 有两种解读：(1) 优化——GB 学到了 annotator majority 的 pattern；\n\n    (2) ceiling 估算保守——真实 ceiling 可能略高于 0.82。\n\n    无论哪种，key takeaway 是：0.839 和 0.798 之间的差距（4.1pp）在 ceiling ~0.82 的 context 下\n\n    已经不小了——但也说明任何进一步提升都极为困难。\n\n    论文 reframe κ=0.39：\"stagnation is inherently ambiguous. We provide the first systematic\n\n    quantification of this ambiguity for agent trajectory analysis. The low κ reflects\n\n    the construct''s definitional challenges, not annotation failure.\"\n\n    这把 weakness 转为 contribution——比假装 κ 很高更有学术价值。\n\n    '\n- name: Stride Sensitivity Analysis\n  plan_id: stride-sensitivity\n  description: Window stride ablation (1/3/5)：对 effective sample size 和 model performance\n    的影响\n  expected_results:\n    probe_results:\n      stride_1:\n        macro_f1: 0.9055\n        train_windows: 38161\n        test_windows: 8101\n        effective_n_ratio: 1.0\n      stride_3:\n        macro_f1: 0.893\n        train_windows: 12720\n        test_windows: 2700\n        effective_n_ratio: 0.72\n        delta_vs_s1_pp: -1.3\n      stride_5:\n        macro_f1: 0.878\n        train_windows: 7632\n        test_windows: 1620\n        effective_n_ratio: 0.45\n        delta_vs_s1_pp: -2.8\n    structural_results:\n      stride_1_rf: 0.9951\n      stride_3_rf: 0.993\n      stride_5_rf: 0.99\n    bootstrap_ci_comparison:\n      stride_1_ci_width_pp: 3.2\n      stride_3_ci_width_pp: 4.8\n      stride_5_ci_width_pp: 6.1\n    autocorrelation:\n      stride_1_lag1: 0.89\n      stride_3_lag1: 0.52\n      stride_5_lag1: 0.11\n  result_rationale: 'Stride=1 的窗口共享 4/5 steps（k=5），相邻窗口相关性极高（lag-1 autocorrelation\n    0.89）。\n\n    这不影响 model 训练（更多数据总是有帮助），但影响统计推断——bootstrap CI 基于独立性假设，\n\n    实际 CI 应比报告的更宽。Stride=3 autocorrelation 降到 0.52，stride=5（无重叠）降到 0.11。\n\n    Probe F1 从 stride=1 的 0.906 降到 stride=5 的 0.878 (-2.8pp)——主要是训练数据量减少的影响。\n\n    Structural RF 几乎不受影响（0.995→0.990）——因为 RF 不依赖序列信息且样本足够。\n\n    Key finding：stride=5 的 bootstrap CI 是 stride=1 的 ~2x 宽——某些 \"significant\" 结果可能\n\n    在独立采样下变为 non-significant。不影响主结论但需在 paper 中注明。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Stride Sensitivity'\n    content: '| Stride | Probe F1 | RF F1  | Train N  | Autocorr (lag-1) | 95% CI\n      width (pp) |\n\n      |--------|----------|--------|----------|------------------|--------------------|\n\n      | 1      | 0.906    | 0.995  | 38,161   | 0.89             | ±1.6               |\n\n      | 3      | 0.893    | 0.993  | 12,720   | 0.52             | ±2.4               |\n\n      | 5      | 0.878    | 0.990  | 7,632    | 0.11             | ±3.1               |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: stride vs F1 (probe 和 structural 两条线) + stride vs CI width (secondary\n    y-axis)。'\n  analysis: '主要影响是 statistical precision 而非 model quality。Stride=1 的 CI 可能过于乐观。\n\n    建议论文报告 stride=1 结果但注明 effective sample size 调整，\n\n    在 appendix 提供 stride=5 robustness check。不改变定性结论但增强可信度。\n\n    '\n- name: Feature Importance Figure (SHAP/Permutation)\n  plan_id: feature-importance-figure\n  description: SHAP/permutation importance 分析 structural model，区分 LF-overlap vs residual\n    features\n  expected_results:\n    top_10_features:\n    - name: repeated_cmd_ratio\n      shap_mean: 0.281\n      lf_overlap: true\n      lf: cmd_rep\n    - name: unique_file_edits\n      shap_mean: 0.192\n      lf_overlap: true\n      lf: file_diff\n    - name: action_diversity_index\n      shap_mean: 0.098\n      lf_overlap: partial\n    - name: consecutive_same_action\n      shap_mean: 0.078\n      lf_overlap: true\n      lf: cmd_rep\n    - name: error_count\n      shap_mean: 0.062\n      lf_overlap: false\n    - name: mean_step_tokens\n      shap_mean: 0.048\n      lf_overlap: false\n    - name: file_diff_magnitude\n      shap_mean: 0.041\n      lf_overlap: true\n      lf: file_diff\n    - name: unique_commands\n      shap_mean: 0.038\n      lf_overlap: partial\n    - name: output_length_variance\n      shap_mean: 0.031\n      lf_overlap: false\n    - name: task_outcome_signal\n      shap_mean: 0.028\n      lf_overlap: true\n      lf: outcome_bp\n    lf_overlap_pct_of_total_importance: 72.3\n    non_lf_features_pct: 27.7\n    top2_are_lf_direct: true\n    permutation_importance_correlation_with_shap: 0.94\n  result_rationale: 'Structural model（RF/GB）的输入是 30 个手工特征，其中多个直接对应 LF 的计算逻辑。\n\n    SHAP 分析在 worst 档下显示：top 2 features (repeated_cmd_ratio, unique_file_edits) 直接\n\n    映射到 cmd_rep 和 file_diff LFs，合计占 47.3% 的总 importance。\n\n    Top 10 中有 5 个直接 LF-overlap，占 72.3% importance——这视觉化地证实了 circularity concern。\n\n    Non-LF features（error_count, mean_step_tokens, output_length_variance）确实有贡献（27.7%），\n\n    说明模型学到了一些 beyond-LF 信号，但这些 residual features 不足以独立支撑 \"structural features\n\n    capture something fundamentally different from LF heuristics\" 的 claim。\n\n    Feature-overlap-ablation 实验已显示 11 个 non-overlap features 的 cross-agent F1=0.977\n\n    （仅 +1pp vs 30 features 的 0.967），但这在 worst 档下反而说明 non-overlap features\n\n    也可能在学 LF-correlated signal，只是间接的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Top 10 SHAP Feature Importance'\n    content: '| Rank | Feature              | |SHAP| mean | LF Overlap | Cumulative\n      % |\n\n      |------|----------------------|-------------|------------|-------------|\n\n      | 1    | repeated_cmd_ratio   | 0.281       | cmd_rep    | 28.1%       |\n\n      | 2    | unique_file_edits    | 0.192       | file_diff  | 47.3%       |\n\n      | 3    | action_diversity     | 0.098       | partial    | 57.1%       |\n\n      | 4    | consecutive_same_act | 0.078       | cmd_rep    | 64.9%       |\n\n      | 5    | error_count          | 0.062       | none       | 71.1%       |\n\n      | 6    | mean_step_tokens     | 0.048       | none       | 75.9%       |\n\n      | 7    | file_diff_magnitude  | 0.041       | file_diff  | 80.0%       |\n\n      | 8    | unique_commands      | 0.038       | partial    | 83.8%       |\n\n      | 9    | output_length_var    | 0.031       | none       | 87.0%       |\n\n      | 10   | task_outcome_signal  | 0.028       | outcome_bp | 89.8%       |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'SHAP beeswarm plot: top 15 features，color-coded by LF overlap (red=direct LF,\n    orange=partial, blue=non-LF)。'\n  - 'Stacked bar: total importance 分解为 LF-direct (48%), LF-partial (14%), non-LF (28%),\n    other (10%)。'\n  analysis: 'SHAP 图在 worst 档下成为 double-edged sword：视觉化地确认了 structural model 主要在\n\n    reverse-engineer LF heuristics（72% importance from LF-overlapping features）。\n\n    但也展示了 ~28% 的 non-LF signal——这支持 \"structural features capture more than LFs\" 的弱版\n    claim。\n\n    论文应诚实呈现：structural model ≈ 70% LF reconstruction + 30% residual signal。\n\n    The 30% residual explains why GB (0.839) > MV (0.798) on gold: some non-LF features\n\n    provide genuine stagnation signal beyond what LFs capture.\n\n    '\n- name: Trajectory Visualization\n  plan_id: trajectory-visualization\n  description: 选择代表性轨迹生成 LF activation overlay 图，建立 semantic stagnation 直觉\n  expected_results:\n    n_example_trajectories: 4\n    selected_types:\n    - clear stagnation tail (all LFs agree)\n    - semantic stagnation (diverse actions but no progress)\n    - false positive (looks stagnant but making progress)\n    - recovery after stagnation\n    visualization_elements:\n    - step-by-step action labels (abbreviated)\n    - LF activation overlay (cmd_rep / file_diff / OB)\n    - probe prediction confidence band\n    - structural model prediction\n    - gold label (where available)\n  result_rationale: '定性可视化不产生量化 metrics，但对 reviewer 建立直觉至关重要。\n\n    在 worst 档下，FP case（false positive）特别重要——展示 agent 在做 diverse edits 但\n\n    模型（和 LFs）误判为 stagnation 的情况，帮助 reviewer 理解 error pattern。\n\n    Recovery case 支持 \"不是所有 stagnation 都是 terminal\" 的叙事，为 intervention 的谨慎定位提供直觉。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - '4-panel figure: 每 panel 一条轨迹。横轴=steps，纵轴=stacked LF activations + model confidence。Gold\n    label 用背景色标注。Caption 解释每个 case 的 stagnation 模式。'\n  analysis: '可视化不改变定量结论，但帮助 reviewer 理解 \"semantic stagnation\" 为何难以定义（对应 κ=0.39）。\n\n    FP case 直接对应 error-analysis 发现（FP dominant, highly confident, mean prob=0.922）。\n\n    Recovery case 为 intervention 的谨慎设计提供 motivation——不是所有检测到的 stagnation 都应 terminate。'\n","numLines":1077,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1077}}}
